<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">YOCWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Yocwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yocwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoc</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOCWA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Yocwa </char> tito kit ma jo Icrael, ite loc pa Yocwa, gumayo kwede lobo me Kanaan. Yocwa aye ngat ma oleyo kaka Moses ci omayo lobo Kanaan ki lweny ma dongo ma onongo jo Icrael loyo merokgi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jami ma dongo ma otime ma kicoyo i buk man, ikine aye ngolo kulu Jordan, gamo Jeriko, lweny i Ai ki roco cike ikin Lubanga ki jone.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok acel madit me niye ma i buk man en aye ni, “Ka pe wumito woro Rwot, ci tin dong wuyer ngat ma wubitiyo bote, ento an gira ki jo ma i oda ducu wabitiyo bot Rwot.” 24:15</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Mayo lobo Kanaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 1:1-12:24">1:1—12:24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Poko lobo Kanaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 13:1-21:45">13:1—21:45</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Lobo ma tung kunyango me Jordan <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 13:1-33">13:1-33</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Lobo ma tung kupotoceng me Jordan <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 14:1-19:51">14:1—19:51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Taun madito me laro kwo pa lunek <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">20:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Taun madito pi Lulevi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 21:1-45">21:1-45</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kaka ma tung kunyango me Jordan gudok i lobogi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 22:1-34">22:1-34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me agiki pa Yocwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 23:1-16">23:1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Roco gicike ki Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOS 24:1-33">24:1-33</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Miyo tic ki Yocwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Ka Moses latic pa Rwot dong oto woko, ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa wod pa Nun ma lakony pa Moses ni, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Latica Moses dong oto woko; pimeno in aye dong ia malo, icit ingol loka Jordan, in ki lwak man ducu, wucit wa i lobo ma abimiyo botgi ni, gin jo Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:24-25">Nwo 11:24-25</ref></char></note>Kabedo ducu ma tyenwu binyono abimiyo botwu, kit mayam aciko ki Moses. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Cake wa ki i tim kany ki i Lebanon nio kwede wa i kulu madit, en aye kulu Euprate, lobo ducu pa jo Kit nio wa i nam Mediterranean ma tung kupotoceng, ducu bibedo lobowu. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Nwo 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Ibru 13:5</ref></char></note>Pe tye dano mo ma bicung inyimi ikare me kwoni ducu. Kit mayam abedo ki Moses, abibedo kwedi kitmeno; pe abibwoti, pe abitenyi ata. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Nwo 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:23">23</ref></char></note>Bed oteka ma cwinyi nwang, pien ibimiyo rok man leyo lobo mayam akwongo pire bot kwariwu ni abimiyo botgi. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Ento bed oteka ma cwinye nwang, bed ma igwoke kalubu cik mayam latica Moses ociki kwede i gin ma itiyo ducu; pe ingak kun ibwoto lubu lok ma i Cik ducu ma latica Moses ociki, wek ibed ki gum maber i kabedo ducu ma ibicito iye. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Ibikwano buk man me Cik kare ducu, dok bene ibibedo ka lwodone i cwinyi dyeceng ki dyewor, wek igwoke kalubu gin ducu ma kicoyo iyeni. Kitmeno bimiyo nyimi bedo maleng, ka dok tici ducu bicobe kakare. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />An dong atyeko ciki ba. Bed oteka ma cwinyi nwang; pe komi omyel, pe cwinyi oryange, pien Rwot Lubangani tye kwedi kama iwoto iye ducu.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yocwa ociko lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Yocwa ociko ludito ma gin loyo lwak ni, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Wuwot i dye gony ka ciko lwak ni, ‘Wuyub camwu; pien odong nino adek ci wucito kangolo loka kulu Jordan, wucito iye kacamo lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyo botwu me bedo mewu.’”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 32:28-32">Wel 32:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:18-20">Nwo 3:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:1-6">Yoc 22:1-6</ref></char>
    </note>Yocwa dok owaco bot jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace ni, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Wupo lok mayam Moses latic pa Rwot ocikowu kwede kun waco ni, ‘Rwot Lubangawu dong otyeko miyowu kabedo me yweyowu, en dong omiyowu lobo man.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Monwu ki lutinowu ki dyangiwu gibidong i lobo mayam Moses omiyo botwu inge Jordan kany; ento oteka lweny ma gitye ikinwu ducu bikato loka ca ki jami lwenygi ducu inyim omegigi pi konyogi, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />nio ka Rwot omiyo yweyo bot omegiwu macalo omiyo botwu ni, ci gin bene gucamo lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyogi. Ka dong wubidok i lobo ma mewu ni, ci dong wubibedo iye matwal, en aye lobo mayam Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo botwu inge Jordan kany ma tung kunyango.” <verse eid="JOS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Ci gin ogamo dog Yocwa ni, “Gin ma dong iciko ducu wabitiyo, dok kama icwalowa iye ducu wabicito. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Kit macalo yam waworo dog Moses i lok ducu, wan bene wabiworo dogi kitmeno. Rwot Lubanga keken aye obed kwedi, kit mayam obedo ki Moses! <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Dano mo ka okwero loki ce ojemo ikom ciki ki gin ducu ma iciko, kibineke woko. In aye ibed oteka ma cwinyi nwang.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kicwalo lukipiny i Jeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:31">Ibru 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:25">Yak 2:25</ref></char>
    </note>Yocwa wod pa Nun ocwalo jo aryo nia ki i Citim i mung kakiyo piny kun waco botgi ni, “Wucit kaneno lobo, tutwale wucit wukii taun madit me Jeriko.” Ka gucito, ci gucito i ot pa dako ma lakwele ma nyinge Rakab, ci gubutu kunu. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Kitito pirgi bot rwot me Jeriko ni, “Nen, jo Icrael mogo gubino kany kakiyo piny.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Ci rwot me Jeriko ocwalo kwena bot Rakab kun wace ni, “Kel dano ma gubino boti kany, dano ma gudonyo i odini, pien gubino ka roto lobowa ducu.” <verse eid="JOS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Ento dakonu onongo otero jo aryonu okano gi woko, ci en ogamo ni, “Ada, jo meno obino bota, ento onongo pe angeyo kama gua ki iye. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Ikare ma dong ki cok loro dog cel me taun madit woko, ma piny colli, jo meno gukato woko, ci kama gucito iye aye pe angeyo. Wuryem korgi oyotoyot, ci wubimakogi i yoo.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Ento en onongo dong oterogi iwi ot malo, ci okanogi ikin tol tworo ma ocano kikore iwi ot kunu. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Kitmeno jonu gucako ryemo korgi i yoo nio wa iwang wat me kulu Jordan. Cutcut ka luryem korgi gukato woko, ci dog cel me taun madit kiloro woko.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Ikare ma jo meno peya gubutu piny, en ocito botgi iwi ot, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />ci owaco botgi ni, “Angeyo ni Rwot otyeko miyowu lobo man, lworo bene otyeko makowa pirwu, ki jo ma gibedo i loboni komgi oonyo koyo woko pirwu. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Nia 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref></char></note>Pien wawinyo kit ma Rwot otwoyo ki pii me Nam Makwar woko inyimwu ikare ma wua woko ki i Ejipt, ki gin ma wutiyo ikom luker aryo pa jo Amor mayam gin bedo loka Jordan tung kany, gin aye Cikon ki Og, ma wujwerogi woko liwengi. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Ikare ma wawinyo pire cwinywa ocako ngabe angaba cut, ci tipu kom dano oto woko lirut pirwu, pien Rwot Lubangawu aye Lubangawu aye matye laloc malo i polo ki piny iwi lobo bene. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Kombedi dong wukwonga kwong ki nying Rwot ni, wubitimo jo me ot pa wora maber, kit macalo atyeko timowu maberi. Piman dong wumiya lanyut ma moko adane, <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />wek wular kwo pa wora ki pa maa, ki pa omegina ki lumegina, ki jo ducu ma gin tye botgi, wek wular kwowa wek pe wa to.” <verse eid="JOS 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Jo meno gugamo ni, “Rwot aye omyero onek wan, ka pe watimo gin ma wacike iye kanyi. Dong ka pe ibitito bot ngat mo gin ma wabedo katimo kany, ci wacike boti me timo in maber ka Rwot omiyo bot wa lobo man.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Lacen dako meno oweko gukato woko ki iwang dirica ma nongo en cwalogi piny ki tol, pien onongo ode kigero okube ikom icel murumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cel me Jeriko onongo tye aryo. Ma woko ki ma i iye. Kin gi romo mita adek ki nucu nio wa i mita angwen ki nucu ma jo mukene bedo iye. Dirica bedo tye icel ma woko.</char></note> Jeriko. Man nyutu ni en yam bedo ikin cel. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Ci en ocikogi ni, “Kong wucit wa ikin godi, wek luryem korwu pe gurwate kwedwu i yoo. Kong wukane kunu pi nino adek, nio ka luryem korwu dong gudwogo; ka lacen wun dong wucit giwu.” <verse eid="JOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Jo meno guwaco bote ni, “Pe wabibedo ki bal mo ikom kwong man ma imiyo wakwongo botini. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Nen ba, ka monywa obino i loboni, ci ibitweyo tol man makwari iwang dirica ma imiyo wakato woko kun wawok ki iyeni. Ci bene ibilwongo woru ki meni ki omegini ki jo ma i ot pa woru ducu, kun icokogi iot boti kany. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Ka ngat acel mo okato gire woko ki i dogola me otti ce ocito i gudu, bal me remone bidok i wiye, wan pe wabibedo ki bal mo iye, ento ka kiwano ngat matye i ot boti, ci bale bibedo mewa. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Ento kace itito gin ma watimo kanyi, ci pe wabibedo ki bal mo pi kwong ma imiyo wakwongoni.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Dakonu ogamo ni, “Dong obed kitmeno kit macalo wulokoni.” Ka ocwalogi gin ocito, ci en otweyo tol makwari iwang dirica ode.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Ka gucito ci guwoto atir wa i godi, gubedo kunu pi nino adek, nio ka luryem korgi gudok woko; lulub korgi obedo ka yenyogi kwe i wangayo, ci pe gumedo ki onongogi. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Ci jo aryonu gulor piny ki iwi godi, gukato loka ca ci gucito bot Yocwa wod pa Nun. Ci gutito bote lok ducu ma otime ikomgi. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Ka dok guwaco bot Yocwa ni, “Adada Rwot dong otyeko miyo lobo meno ducu i cingwa; ki bene lworo madit opoto ikom jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo meno woko lirut ikare ma guwinyo pirwa.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gukato loka Jordan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Yocwa oa malo odiko con ci ocako wot kun a ki i Citim, kacel ki jo Icrael ducu, gucito wa i dog kulu Jordan. Ci gubutu kenyo ma peya gukato loka tung ca. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Ka gutyeko kunu nino adek, ci ludito owoto i dye gony <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />kun giciko lwak ni, “Ka dong wuneno ajwaki ma Lulevi dong gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot Lubangawu, ci wun bene dong wubicako wot, wua ki i kabedowu wulubu kore, <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />wek wunge yoo ma wubilubu ni, pien yam peya wulubu yoo meno. Ento kinwu ki Canduk pa Rwot aye obed ma oyute; ber kinwu opoke maromo kilomita acel kulu ingegi, pe wunyik cok ki Canduk.” <verse eid="JOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Ci Yocwa ociko lwak ni, “Wulonye kekenwu wek wubed maleng, pien diki Rwot bitiyo jami tango ikinwu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Yocwa owaco bot ajwaki ni, “Dong wuting Canduk me Gicike, wukat kwede inyim lwak.” Ci gin gutingo Canduk me Gicike, gucito kwede wa inyim lwak.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Tin dong abitiyo gin madit mamiyo ibedo dano madit ki inyim jo Icrael ducu, wek gunge ni, kit mayam abedo ki Moses, abibedo kwedi bene kitmeno. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Ibiciko ajwaki ma gitingo Canduk me Gicike ni, ‘Ka dong wuo i dog pii me Jordan, ci wubicung mot i kulu Jordan.’” <verse eid="JOS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Ci Yocwa owaco bot lwak ni, “Dong wubin kany ka winyo lok pa Rwot Lubangawu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Ka dok owaco ni, “Kombedi dong wubingeyo ni Lubanga makwo tye ikinwu, dok ni en biryemo jo magi woko ki inyimwu ada, jo Kanaan, jo Kit, jo Kiv, jo Periji, jo Girgac, jo Amor ki jo Jebuc. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Ka Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot me lobo ducu dong bingolo kulu Jordan ki inyimwu. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Ci koni dong wukwany dano apar wiye aryo ki ikin kaka pa jo Icrael, dano acel pi kaka acel acel. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Ikare ma tyen ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot Lubanga, ma en Rwot me lobo ducuni, bicung i pii me Jordan, ci pii me Jordan bingol woko ma pe dong mol; ci pii ma mol a ki malo tung celi bigut gure kacel.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Kitmeno lwak gua ki i kemagi gucako wot pi ngolo loka Jordan kacel ki ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike ma gutelo kwede nyim lwak. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Nongo pii me kulu Jordan pong woko libyeny oo wa iwi tura mwaka ki mwaka pi kare malac ikare me kac. Ka dong ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicikeni guo i dog kulu Jordan, ci gulutu tyen gi i pii ma i dogeni, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />ci pii ma mol piny ma a ki tung maloni ogut ocung woko ma opong otinge malo likung ma ojer wa i Adam, en taun madit macok ki Jaretan. Pii mogo ma mol kemo nam me Araba, ma en aye Nam me Kadoni, kin gi ducu ongol woko, ci lwak gukato loka tungcel, mukemo Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Ikare ma jo Icrael ducu gimol gikato ki i lobo mutwoni, onongo ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwoti ocung i dye Jordan, nio ka rok ducu otyeko kato loka Jordan.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kiketo godi apar wiye aryo me lapowic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Ka lwak ducu dong gutyeko kato loka Jordan, ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Kwany dano apar wiye aryo ki ikin lwak, dano acel pi kaka acel acel, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />ci icikgi ni, ‘Wukwany godi apar wiye aryo ki kany ki i dye Jordan, ki i kabedo ma tyen ajwaki ocung iyeni, wuting wukat kwedgi wa loka ca, ci wuketgi piny i kabedo ma tin wucito kabutu iyeni.’” <verse eid="JOS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Yocwa olwongo dano apar wiye aryo ki ikin jo Icrael ma nene en oyerogi, ma laco acel oa ki i kaka acel acel. <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />Ci owaco botgi ni, “Wukat wucit wa inyim Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot Lubangawu ma i dye Jordan ni, dano acel acel oting iye got oket iwi gwoke, ma oporo wel kaka pa jo Icrael ducu, <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />wek gubed me lanyut ikinwu. Ikare me anyim ka wang mo lutinowu bipenyowu ni, ‘Godi magi kono nyutu gin ango?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Wun wubitito botgi ni, pii me Jordan yam iye opoke ongol woko ki inyim Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot, ikare ma canduk ngolo Jordan kato kwede loka ca. Kitmeno godi magi bibedo gin me nipo matwal bot jo Icrael.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Jo Icrael gutimo kit ma Yocwa ocikogi kwede. Gin gutingo godi apar wiye aryo ki i dye Jordan, ma oporo wel kaka pa jo Icrael, kit ma nene Rwot otito bot Yocwa ni gin guting gucit kwedgi loka ca, wa i kabedo ma gicito kabutu iyeni, ci gin guketogi piny kunu. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />(Yocwa bene ocibo godi apar wiye aryo i dye Jordan, i kabedo kama tyen ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike ocung iye. Pud gitye kunu wa onyo.) <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Pien onongo ajwaki ma gutingo canduki ocung kenyo i dye Jordan nio ka gin ducu ma nene Rwot ociko ki Yocwa ni otit bot lwak otum, marom ki cik mayam Moses ociko ki Yocwa ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 4:10">Lwak ducu gumol oyotoyot wa loka ca. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Ka lwak ducu gumol gukato loka ca, ci Canduk pa Rwot ki ajwaki bene gukato loka inyim lwak. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Jo pa Reuben ki pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace onongo guruku jami lwenygi gutelo kwede nyim lwak jo Icrael kit mayam Moses ocikogi kwedeni. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Onongo jo gi ma guruke me lweny guromo alip pyere angwen, ci gukato loka ca inyim Rwot Lubanga kalweny i lobo bar matye cok ki Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Rwot omiyo Yocwa obedo dano madit inyim jo Icrael ducu; ci lwak guworo Yocwa wa ikare me kwone ducu kit mayam gin guworo kwede ki Moses.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Cik ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike dong gua woko ki i Jordan.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Yocwa ociko ajwaki ni, “Dong wua woko ki i Jordan.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Ka ajwaki ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot gua woko ki i dye Jordan gukato wi tura; ma tyen gi ocako nyono lobo ma wi tura mutwo ni, ci pii me Jordan ocore odwogo cen i kabedone, opongo piny woko libyeny wa iwi tura odoco.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Ci lwak gua woko ki i Jordan gukato iwi tura inino dwe apar me dwe mukwongo, ci gutongo gonygi i Gilgal iwang lobo Jeriko matye tung kunyango. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Ci godi apar wiye aryo ma gin gutingo ki i Jordan ni, Yocwa ocibogi i Gilgal. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Ci owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Ikare me anyim, ka likwayowu gupenyo wegigi ni, ‘Godi magi kono nyutu gin ango?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Ci wubitito bot lutinowu ni, jo Icrael yam gumol gukato ki i Jordan kany ma lobone otwo woko. <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu omiyo pii me Jordan otwo odwon woko pirwu nio ka wumol wukato loka kany, kit mayam Rwot Lubangawu otiyo ki Nam Makwari, mayam omiyo piine otwo odwon woko pirwa nio ka wamol wakato loka tungcel, <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />man otime wek rok ducu ma wi lobo ni onge atir ni cing Rwot tye ki tek; dok bene wek wubed ka lworo Rwot Lubangawu matwal.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Ka luker pa jo Amor ducu ma gibedo loka Jordan ma tung kupotoceng, ki luker pa jo Kanaan ducu ma gitye i dog nam, guwinyo ni Rwot otyeko dwono pii me Jordan otwo woko pi jo Icrael nio ka gumol gukato loka tungcel, ci cwinygi ocako ngabe angaba, ki tipu komgi oto woko lirut, pi lworo jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Liro yalwak manyen i Gilgal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Ikare meno Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Yub pala kidi lela mabite ci ilir ki jo Icrael.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Ci Yocwa oyubu pala kidi lela mabite, oliro ki jo Icrael i Gibea-aralot. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:28-35">Wel 14:28-35</ref></char></note>Man aye tyen lok ma omiyo Yocwa olirogi: lwak co ducu ma oa ki i Ejipt ki lulwenygi ducu, onongo gutyeko to woko ki i tim ma dong gutyeko a woko ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Jo ma gua ki i Ejipt onongo yam dong kilirogi woko, ento jo ducu ma ki nywalogi ki i wangayo, onongo peya kilirogi. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Pien jo Icrael gubedo kawot i tim pi mwaka pyere angwen, nio ka jo me rokgi ducu, co ducu ma lumony mayam gua ki i Ejipt, guto gutum woko, pien onongo pe gubedo ka woro dog Rwot. Rwot yam okwongo ni pe ebiye ni gunen lobo mayam en ekwongo bot kwarigi ni ebimiyo botgi, en aye lobo ma maber ma ceko cam mapol. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Kitmeno jo ma Yocwa oliro obedo lutinogi ma Rwot omiyo gin odongo oleyo katyen gi; pien onongo gin obedo ma pe kilirogi ki i wangayo.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Ka liro jo Icrael dong otum, ci gubedo i gony nio ka gucang. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Tin dong akwanyo lewic me lobo Ejipt woko ki ikomwu,” ma omiyo nying kabedo meno pud kilwongo ni Gilgal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="fk">Gilgal </char> gonye bene ni kwanyo lewic.</note> wa onyo.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Nia 12:1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare ma jo Icrael gitye i gony me Gilgal gukwero nino madit me Kato inino dwe apar wiye angwen i otyeno kama obedo barbar macok ki Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Orwone ki inge kwero Kato, inino meno kikome, gin gucako camo cam ma ocek i lobo meno, capat ma tobi peke iye ki bel ma kicelo. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Nia 16:35</ref></char></note>Inino meno ma gucamo iye cam ma ocek ki i lobonu en aye nino ma manna bene ogik iye; jo Icrael pe dok gumede ki camo manna matwal, ento dong gubedo kacamo cam ma ocek i lobo Kanaan i mwaka meno.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yocwa ki laco matye ki pala lucwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Ka Yocwa onyiko cok ki Jeriko, ci nen, laco mo onongo ocung inyime ma omako pala lucwan i cinge. Ci Yocwa ocito bote, openye ni, “In itye tung botwa nyo tung bot lumerokwa?” <verse eid="JOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />En ogamo ni, “Pe; ento an aye lawimony pa Rwot ma tin dong abino.” Yocwa oryebe piny i ngom, owore, ci owaco bote ni, “Ladit, an latici, icika ki lok ango?” <verse eid="JOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Lawimony pa Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Luny war woko ki i tyeni, pien kabedo ma icung iyeni kabedo maleng.” Ci Yocwa otimo kitmeno.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gumako Jeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Ikare meno onongo Jeriko kicego woko matek tutwal pi lworo jo Icrael; onongo dano mo pe kato woko, dok dano mo pe donyo i iye bene. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Nen, dong atyeko miyo Jeriko i cingi kacel ki rwote ki twoni oteka lwenye. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Wubiwot wurumu taun madit meno; lulweny ducu biwot kun rumu taun madit tyen acel inino acel. Ci wubitiyo kitmeno pi nino abicel, <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />kun ajwaki abiro bimako obute me tung romi gitelo kwede nyim Canduk me Gicike. Inino me abirone wubiwot wurumu taun madit meno tyen abiro kun ajwaki gikutu obute. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Ka dong kikutu tung nyogi romi, ci ka wuwinyo dwon obute ma longoni, ci lwak ducu bidange ki dwon gi ma longo mapek; ci cel gogo me taun madit bimuk, poto woko piny ducu, ci lwak gibicore gicito iye kun dano acel acel kemo nyime atir.” <verse eid="JOS 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Ci Yocwa wod pa Nun olwongo ajwaki, owaco botgi ni, “Wuting Canduk me Gicike. Ajwaki abiro gumak obute tung nyogi romi gutel kwede nyim Canduk pa Rwot.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Ka dok owaco ki lwak ni, “Wuwot anyim, wuwot wurum taun madit man, wumii jo ma guruku jami lwenygi gukat wa inyim Canduk pa Rwot.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Kit ma Yocwa ociko ki lwaki, ajwaki abiro gumako obute tung nyogi romi abiro ci gutelo kwede nyim Rwot kun gicito anyim kacel ki Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot malubu korgi. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Lumony gutelo nyim ajwaki ma gikutu obute ni, ci lugwok tung angec gulubu kor Canduk, kun obute kikutu kimede kwede ameda. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Ento Yocwa ociko lumony ni, “Pe wubidange ki wo, kadi wa dwonwu bene pe biwinye, wa lok mo pe bia ki i dogwu, nio kwede wa inino ma abicikowu ni dong wudange ki wo; ka dong wubidange.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Kitmeno Yocwa omiyo Canduk pa Rwot ocako wot me rumu taun madit, kun rumu tyen acel keken. Lacen gudok i gony, gubutu kunu.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Yocwa dok oa malo odiko con, ki ajwaki bene gucako tingo Canduk pa Rwot. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Ajwaki abiro gumako obute tung nyogi romi abiro gukato kwede inyim Canduk pa Rwot, kun gimede kikutu obute nakanaka. Lumony gutelo nyimgi, ki lugwok tung angec gulubu kor Canduk, kun ajwaki gikutu obute nakanaka. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Inino me aryone guwoto gurumu taun Jeriko tyen acel ci gudok i gony. Gubedo karumu gangi kitmeno pi nino abicel.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Ikom nino me abirone gua malo kwarpiny, guwoto gurumu taun Jeriko kit mayam ca tyen abiro; inino meno keken aye gurumu iye taun Jeriko tyen abiro. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Ikom tyen me abirone en aye ajwaki gucako kutu iye obute, ka Yocwa owaco bot lumony ni, “Wudange, wuwo, pien Rwot dong omiyo taun madit man botwu. <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Ento taun madit man ki gin ducu matye iye ki bidyerogi bot Rwot ci ki bijwero woko ducu. Rakab ma lakweleni keken, ki jo ducu ma gitye i ode, aye gibidong makwo, pien en yam okano lurotpiny ma wacwalo kunu. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Ento wun aye wugwoke kekenwu ikom gin ducu ma kidyero me ajwera woko, pe dok wukwany gin mo ki ikom gin ma wudyeroni, miyo gony pa jo Icrael bidoko me ajwera woko ducu, ci kelo ayela ikom gony pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Ento ryal ki jabu ducu ki jami me molagu ki me nyonyogu, gin ducu jami maleng pa Rwot; kibiterogi i ot kano lim pa Rwot.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:30">Ibru 11:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kitmeno lumony gudange ki woo ki ajwaki gukutu tum obute. Teki lumony guwinyo dwon obute ci gutugi dange ki twon woo mo matek, ci cel taun madit me Jeriko omuk opoto woko piny ducu, ka dong lumony gudonyo i taun madit kun dano acel acel woto tiko nyime atir, ci gumako taun madit man woko. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Gujwero co wa ki mon lutino ki ludongo ducu, ki dyangi ki romi ki kanagu; gin ducu gutum woko kun kinekogi ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilaro Rakab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Ci Yocwa owaco bot jo aryo mayam guroto lobo ni, “Wucit i ot pa dako ma lakweleni, wukele woko ki jone ducu, kit mayam wukwongo boteni.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Kitmeno awobe mayam guroto lobo gudonyo i ot, gukelo Rakab woko kacel ki wone ki mine ki omegine ki jone ducu. Ci gutero ludogola pa Rakab ducu, guketogi woko inge gony pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Lacen lumony guwango taun madit me Jeriko woko ki mac, ki gin ducu matye iye; ento guweko ryal ki jabu ki jami me mola ki me nyonyo keken, ma guketogi i ot ma kikano iye lim pa Rwot. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Ibru 11:31</ref></char></note>Ento Rakab ma lakweleni ki jo me ot pa wone kacel ki jone ducu, Yocwa owekogi makwo. Ci gudoko lubedo ikin jo Icrael nio wa onyo, pien Rakab yam okano lukwena ma Yocwa onongo ocwalogi kakiyo piny i Jeriko.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:34">1 Luk 16:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Yocwa omiyo dano gukwongo kwong inyim Rwot kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">“Cen opot ikom dano ma bitinge pi gero taun madit man me Jeriko odoco.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">Latin kayone bito, ci kibiketo gutine iwiye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">ki wode ma cogone bito, ci kibicibo dog cel me taun madit man iwiye.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Kitmeno Rwot obedo ki Yocwa, omiyo nyinge oywek oromo i lobo ducu.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa Akan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Ento jo Icrael gungayo wang Rwot i lok mamako jami ma onongo kidyero bote. Akan wod pa Karmi, wod pa Jabdi, wod pa Jera ma i kaka pa Juda okwanyo jami mogo ma kidyerogi bot Rwot, omiyo kiniga omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Yocwa ocwalo dano ki i Jeriko me cito wa i Ai macok ki Bet-aven, inget Betel tung kunyango, ci owaco botgi ni, “Wucit kakiyo lobo kuca.” Jo meno gucito guroto Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Ka gudwogo bot Yocwa ci gutito bote ni, “Pe iwek mony ducu gucit kunu, ento wek dano alip aryo nyo adek gucit kalweny ikom Ai; pe imii mony ducu guyele gucit kunu, pien jo matye kunu ginok mo.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Ma omiyo dano alip adek ki ikin lumony aye gucito kunu; ci guringo woko ki inyim jo Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Jo Ai guneko jo pyere adek wiye abicel ki ikin gi; guryemo korgi cake ki i dog gang o kwede wa i Cebarim, ci gunekogi i kor got kunu. Ci cwiny jo Icrael obale woko, tekogi okwe woko macalo pii.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Yocwa oyeco bongone woko, ci opoto piny aryeba cwiny inyim Canduk pa Rwot nio wa otyeno, en ki ludongo pa jo Icrael, kun gionyo apwa iwigi. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Ci Yocwa owaco ni, “Maa do, ai Rwot Lubanga, pingo ikelo lwak man loka Jordan kany pi miyowa i cing jo Amor wek gutyekwa woko? Twora yam waye giwa bedo loka Jordan kuca! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Ai Rwot, ka man dok awaco lok ango, ma jo Icrael dong guloke ci guringo woko ki inyim lumerokgini? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Pien jo Kanaan ki jo ducu ma gibedo i loboni ka gibiwinyo pire, gibicore girumuwa woko dyere, ci gibijwayo nyingwa woko ki iwi lobo. Ci gin ango mono ma dok ibitiyo pi nyingi maditi?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “A malo, pingo i poto aryeba cwiny kit man? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Jo Icrael gutimo bal. Gutyeko turu gicikena mayam acikogi kwede. Gin gukwanyo jami mogo mayam kidyerogini. Gukwalo woko, gunginye kwede, ci guketo ikin jamigi. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />En aye lok ma omiyo jo Icrael pe gitwero cung inyim lumerokgi. Gin guloke ci guringo woko ki inyim lumerokgi pien gin kikomgi gudoko gin me ajwera woko. Pe dong abimede kibedo kwedwu, nio wang ma wukwanyo jami ma kidyerogi woko ki ikinwu. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />A malo wek ilony lwak gubed maleng kun iwaco ni, ‘Diki myero wulonye kekenwu wubed maleng, pien Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, jami ma kidyero tye ikinwu, wun jo Icrael. Pieno pe wutwero cung inyim lumerokwu nio wang ma wukwanyo jami ma kidyerogi woko ki ikinwu. <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Diki odiko kibikelowu inyim Rwot kaka ki kaka, ci kaka ma Rwot okwanyo gibibino cok dogola ki dogola; dogola ma Rwot okwanyo bibino ot ki ot; ki ot ma Rwot okwanyo dano matye iye gibibino ki acel acel. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Ngat ma kikwanyo matye ki jami ma kidyeroni kibiwango woko ki mac. En kacel ki jone ki jamigi ducu, pien oturu gicike pa Rwot, dok otimo gin me lewic i Icrael.’”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Kitmeno Yocwa oa malo odiko con, okelo jo Icrael cok inyim Rwot kaka ki kaka, ci gukwanyo kaka pa Juda aye. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />En okelo jo pa Juda, ci kikwanyo dogola pa Jera. Okelo dogola pa Jera kun kelo dano ma iye ki acel acel, ka dok kikwanyo ot pa Jabdi. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Ka dong okelo dano ma i ode ki acel acel, ci kikwanyo Akan wod pa Karmi, lakwar Jera ma i kaka pa Juda. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Ci Yocwa owaco bot Akan ni, “Woda, mi deyo bot Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael kun itucu bali. Tita kombedi gin ma itimo; pe imunga.” <verse eid="JOS 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Ci Akan ocako dok iye ki Yocwa ni, “Ada, abalo inyim Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, man aye gin ma atiyo: <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />ka aneno bongo maber ma oa ki i Cinar ki ikin jami ma kiyakoni, ki cekel me ryal miya aryo, ki dul jabu ma peke romo cekel pyere abic, pirgi obedo mita, ci akwanyogi. Nen, akanogi i ngom i kemana, ryal tye piny itergi.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Ci Yocwa ocwalo lukwena ci guringo i kema pa Akan, gunongo jami meno kikano i kema, kun ryal tye itere piny. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Gukwanyogi woko ki i kema, gukelogi bot Yocwa ki jo Icrael ducu, ci guketogi piny inyim Rwot. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Ci Yocwa ki jo Icrael ducu gukwanyo Akan lakwar Jera kacel ki ryal ki bongo ca ki dul jabu, ki awobene ki anyirane, ki twoni dyangine, ki kanane ki romine, ki kemane ki jami ma en tye kwede ducu, gutero wa i nota me Akor.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="fk">Akor </char> te loke ni Ayela.</note> <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yocwa owaco ni, “Pingo i kelo ayela ikomwa? Tin dong Rwot bikelo ayela ikomi.” Ci jo Icrael ducu gucelogi ki got. Guwango jamigi ki mac ci kicoro got ikomgi. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Lacen gucano got ikome madwong ocudu likung ma pud tye wa onyo, ci kiniga pa Rwot malyeti okwe woko. Pieno nying kabedo meno pud kilwongo ni nota me Akor nio wa onyo.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gumako Ai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Pe ilwor, cwinyi pe opoti. Ter jo ma lulweny ducu kacel kwedi, dong wutugi a, wucit wa i Ai. Nen, dong atyeko miyo rwot me Ai i cingi, ki lwake ducu ki taune madit ki lobone. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Ibitimo Ai ki rwote kit macalo itimo ikom Jeriko ki rwoteni; ento jamine ma kiyako, ki lime makwo, wubitero bedo mewu. Yube me mako taun man kun iturugi atura ki tung kungeye.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Yocwa oa malo ki jo ma lulweny ducu pi cito kalweny ikom Ai. En oyero twoni matego ma oteka lweny alip pyere adek ci ocwalogi ki i dyewor. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Ocikogi ni, “Wubibutu wukane inget taun madit ki tung kungeye. Pe wucit kamabor ki taun madit man, ento wun ducu wubed ma wutere, <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />ci an ki jo ducu ma gitye kweda wabinyiko cok ki taun madit man. Kace jo ma kunu gubino woko kalweny ikomwa, ci wan wabiringo woko ki inyimgi, <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />ci miyo gin gibibino woko karyemo korwa nio ka gin ducu gukato woko ki i taun madit man, pien gibitamo ni waringo woko ki inyimgi kit mayam watimoni. Ka wan watye karingo woko ki inyimgi, <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />wun dong wubia malo ki kama wubutu wukane iyeni, ci wutugi mako taun madit man woko cut, pien Rwot Lubangawu bimiyo i cingwu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Ka dong wutyeko mako, ci wubiwango woko ki mac; kitmeno wubicobo gin ma Rwot ociko. Nen, dong acikowu en.” <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Ci Yocwa ocwalogi woko kitmeno, ci guwoto gucito kama kicikogi ni gucikane iyeni. Gubutu ikin Betel ki Ai, inget Ai tung kupotoceng; ento Yocwa obutu kacel ki lwak i dyewor meno.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Oruune odiko con Yocwa oa malo ocoko mony, ocako cito inyim jo Ai kacel ki ludongo pa Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Jo ma lulweny ducu ma gitye kwede gucito gunyiko cok ki taun madit meno, ci gutongo gony inget Ai tung kumalo, kun nota tye ikin gi ki Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Ci Yocwa otero dano maromo alip abic oketogi gubutu gukane ikin Betel ki Ai inget Ai tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Guketo mony i kabedogi kitmeno kun gony madit tye inyim taun madit tung kumalo ki dul mukane tye inge taun madit tung kupotoceng. Yocwa obutu i nota i dyewor meno.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Ka rwot me Ai oneno man, ci en ki lwake ducu, dano me taun meno, gurune gucito gulor piny odiko con i lung mukemo Araba kalweny ikom jo Icrael; ento rwot me Ai pe ongeyo ni jo mogo gubutu gukane woko inge taun madit. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Ci Yocwa ki jo Icrael guporo ngwec ki inyimgi ni dong kiryemogi woko, kun giringo gidok tung tim. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Kilwongo dano ducu ma i taun madit gucoke kacel kalubu korgi, ka guryemo kor Yocwa gucito kamabor ki taun madit. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Dano acel mo pe ma odong i Ai nyo i Betel ma pe okato woko karyemo kor jo Icrael. Ci gubwoto wa dog taun madit odong twolo pi ryemo kor jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Ka dong Rwot ociko Yocwa ni, “Tir tong alwiro matye i cingini malo, i kem ki Ai, pien abimiyo woko i cingi.” Yocwa otiro tong alwiro matye i cingeni malo, okemo ki taun madit me Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Oyotoyot jo ma gukaneni gua malo ki i kabedogi tek Yocwa oryeyo cinge malo, ci gutware guringo gudonyo i taun madit me Ai, ci gumako woko, ka gurune gucwinyo mac owango Ai woko. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Ka jo Ai guneno tung ngegi, ci nen, yito mac ma wango taun madit meno tye kaduny mutinge wa malo i polo; ci ngwec me laro komgi oloyogi woko, pien onongo jo ma guringo gudok tung timi guloke gudwogo cen kalweny ikomgi. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Ka dong Yocwa ki jo Icrael ducu guneno ni jo ma gubutu angeci dong gumako taun madit woko, ki yito mac ma wang bene dong duny cito malo, ci gudwogo cen kaneko jo Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Jo Icrael ma onongo dong tye i taun madit meno gua gubino kalweny bene ikom jo Ai. Kitmeno jo Icrael onongo orumugi dyere, jo mukene ki tungcel ki jo mukene tung mukene. Ci jo Icrael guneko jo Ai nio ka pe gubwoto dano acel mo ma odong makwo nyo ma oringo obwot. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Ento gumako rwot me Ai makwo, ci gutere bot Yocwa.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Ka jo Icrael dong gutyeko neko jo Ai ducu ma kinongogi kama obedo barbar nyo i tim kama guryemo iye korgini, nio ka gunekogi ducu ki pala lucwan, ma mo pe odong, ci jo Icrael ducu guloke gudok i Ai, guneko dano mudong iye ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Jo me Ai ducu ma guto inino meno, co ki mon, gin romo alip apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Ci Yocwa pe omedo ki dwoko cinge piny ma nongo oilo ki tong alwirone malo, nio ka kijwero jo ma gibedo i Ai woko liweng. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Lim makwo aye ki jami mogo ma kiyako ki i taun madit meno aye jo Icrael gutero obedo meggi, macalo lok mayam Rwot ociko ki Yocwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Kitmeno Yocwa owango Ai woko, oweko odong wi odur ma odure lipim matwal, kit matye kwede wa onyo. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />En odeyo rwot me Ai, ongabo malo iwi yat nio wa otyeno. Ka ceng dong cito kapoto, ci Yocwa ociko dano ni gukwanyo kome woko ki ikom yat, ci gubolo piny i dog cel me taun madit meno kama kidonyo kwede i taun madit meno, ka gucano got ikome madwong likung, ma pud tye kenyo nio kwede wa ikare man.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicoyo Cik ikom Got Ebal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 27:1-26">Nwo 27:1-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:2-8">Nwo 27:2-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yocwa ocano keno tyer iwi got Ebal pi Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Nia 20:25</ref></char></note>kit mayam Moses latic pa Rwot ociko ki jo Icrael. En olubu lok ma kicoyo i buk me Cik pa Moses ni, “Wucan keno tyer ki got ma pe gipayo komgi, ma dano mo pe otingo nyonyo ikome.” En aye gutyero iye gitum awanga bot Rwot, ci gutumu gityer me berbedo. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Ci Yocwa okobo coc me Cik pa Moses kun coyogi ikom godi kunu ki inyim jo Icrael kun lubu kit mayam Moses ocoyo. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Nwo 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:11-14">27:11-14</ref></char></note>Ci jo Icrael ducu, lubedo ki anywali, kacel ki ludongo ki ludito tic ki lungolkopgi, gin ducu gucung inget Canduk pa Rwot tungi ki tungi ki inyim ajwaki ma Lulevi ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot. Nucu dano gucung inyim got Gerijim ki nucu dano gucung inyim got Ebal, kit ma Moses latic pa Rwot okwongo cikogi kwede kit ma myero kilam kwede gum ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Ka lacen Yocwa okwano lok ducu ma i Cik, wa lok me lamo gum ki lok me ceno dano ducu kikore macalo yam kicoyo ducu i buk me Cik. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Lok acel mo pe odong ikom lok ducu ma Moses yam ociko ma Yocwa pe okwano inyim kacoke pa jo Icrael ducu, kacel ki mon ki lutino ki lubedo ma gibedo ikin gi.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Bwola pa jo Gibeon me mako larem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Ka luker ducu ma nene gitye loka Jordan i lobo matye godigodi ki i lobo matye notanota ma orabo nget Nam Mediterranean mukemo Lebanon, ki jo Kit, jo Amor, jo Kanaan, jo Periji, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc guwinyo lok man, <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />gucoke kacel pi lweny ikom Yocwa ki jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Ento ka jo ma gibedo i Gibeon guwinyo gin ma Yocwa otimo ikom Jeriko ki ikom Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />ci gin ki tung botgi gutiyo ki ryeko mamalo mada. Guyubu peke me wot ki kicaa ma otii me atweya iwi kanagi, ki opiru kongo bwino ma guti woko, ma oyec atata ma kidabogi adaba bene, <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />ki war tyen gi ma otii ma kidabogi, ki bongi arukagi ma otii woko; ki pekegi ducu obedo mutwo woko, ma opuri woko bene. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Gucito kwede bot Yocwa i gony ma i Gilgal, ci guwaco bot Yocwa ki bot jo Icrael ni, “Wan wabino ma waa ki i lobo mabor; pieno walegi ni icike kwedwa kombedi.” <verse eid="JOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:32">Nia 23:32</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:12">34:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:2">Nwo 7:2</ref></char></note>Ento jo Icrael guwaco bot jo Kiv ni, “Gwok onyo wubedo ikinwa, ci dok watwero cike kwedwu ningning?” <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Gin guwaco bot Yocwa ni, “Wan dong lutici.” Ci Yocwa openyogi ni, “Wun kono wu jo kwene ka? Dok bene wua ki kwene mono?” <verse eid="JOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Ci gugamo doge ni, “Wan waa ki i lobo mabor mada, ladit, pi nying Rwot Lubangawu ma wawinyo kitito pire, ki pi gin ducu mayam otimo i lobo Ejipt, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref></char></note>ki pi gin ducu ma en otimo ikom luker aryo pa jo Amor mayam gitye loka Jordan ca, Cikon rwot me Kecbon ki Og rwot me Bacan mayam bedo i Acitarot. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Ci ludongowa ki jo ducu ma gibedo i lobowa guwaco botwa ni, ‘Wumak peke me wot i cingwu wek wucit wurwate kwedgi, ci wuwac botgi ni, wan luticwu, wek dong wacike kwedwu.’ <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Mugatiwa ene; wakwanyo ma onongo pud lyet ikare ma wa a ki pacowa me acama i yoo inino ma wacako bino botwuni, ento kombedi, nen, tye madong otwo dok opuri woko bene. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Wa opiru kongo bwino ducu onongo pud ginyen ikare ma wapiko kongo bwino i igini; dong wunen ba ka guyec woko. Ki ginarukawa ki war mewa dong gutii woko pi wot man mabori.” <verse eid="JOS 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Ludito gugamo pekegi gucamo, ma pe kong gupenyo dog Rwot. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Ci Yocwa otugi yubu lok me kuc ikin gi, ocike kwedgi pi wekogi makwo; lutela wi lwak bene gukwongo kwong botgi.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Ka nino okato adek nia ki ikom nino ma gucike kwedgi, lacen guwinyo ni jo meno gitye kacel kwedgi kun gibedo idyegi. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Jo Icrael gucako wot ci guo i taun madito pa jo meno inge nino me adeke. Gunongo taun madito magi, ma gin aye, Gibeon, Kepira, Beeroth ki Kiriat-jearim. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Ento jo Icrael pe dong gunekogi, pien lutela wi lwak onongo dong gutyeko kwonge botgi i nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. Ci lwak ducu gucako ngur ikom lutela wi lwak. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Ento lutela wi lwak ducu guwaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Watyeko dong kwongo kwong botgi i nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, pieno kombedi pe dong watwero timo komgi marac. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Dong wabitimogi kit man; wabiweko gibedo makwo wek pe wakel kiniga pa Lubanga ikomwa pi kwong ma dong wakwongo botgini.” <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Ci lutela guwaco bot lwak ni, “Wuwek gubed makwo, ento gibibedo lubar yen ki lutwom pii pi lwak ducu.”<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Yocwa olwongogi ci owaco botgi ni, “Pingo wubwola kun wuwaco ni, ‘Wan watye kamabor kwedwu,’ kun kono wutye i dyewa? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Pimeno kombedi dong kicenowu woko; pi kare ducu wubibedo opii, lubar yen ki lutwom pii i ot pa Lubangana.” <verse eid="JOS 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Gugamo dog Yocwa ni, “Pien onongo dong kitito botwa lok me ada ladit, ni Rwot Lubanga yam ociko latice Moses pi miyowu lobo man ducu, dok ociko ni myero wujwer jo ma gibedo i lobo man woko ki inyimwu; omiyo walworowu matek tutwal, en aye omiyo watimo man pi laro kwowa. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Ci dong kombedi in aye dong inen giri. Dong watye i cingi, in dong i tim gin ma i neno ni ber dok opore me atima ikomwa.” <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Ci Yocwa otimogi kit man, olarogi ki i cing jo Icrael, pe dong kinekogi. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Ento cake inino meno Yocwa oketogi me bedo lubar yen ki lutwom pii pi lwak ki pi keno tyer pa Rwot. Gin dong gitye katiyo tic man nio kwede wa onyo ki i kabedo ducu ma Rwot biyero me wore.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael oloyo jo Amor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Adoni-jedek rwot me Jerucalem owinyo kit ma Yocwa otyeko mako kwede Ai, ki kit ma ojwero woko liweng kun otiyo ikom Ai ki rwote kit ma otiyo kwede ikom Jeriko ki rwote. En owinyo bene kit ma jo Gibeon guyubu kwede lok me bedo ki kuc ki jo Icrael, ci dong gitye bene ikin gi. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Ci lworo omake matek tutwal, pien onongo Gibeon taun madit marom aroma ki taun ma dongo mukene, dok onongo dit makato Ai, ki jo ma gibedo iye gubedo twoni matego. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Ma omiyo Adoni-jedek rwot me Jerucalem ocwalo kwena bot Kokam rwot me Kebron, Piram rwot me Jarmut, Japia rwot me Lakic ki Debir rwot me Eglon kun waco botgi ni, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“Wubin bota, wukonya, wubin walwenyu ikom jo Gibeon, pien dong guyubu lok me bedo ki kuc ikin gi ki Yocwa: ki jo Icrael.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Ci luker pa jo Amor abici gucoko monygi, gucito kacel ki lulwenygi ducu, gutongo gony cok ki Gibeon, gucako lweny ikome.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Ci jo Gibeon gucwalo kwena bot Yocwa wa i gony ma i Gilgal kun giwaco ni, “Pe i wekwa woko ata, wan lutici; bin botwa oyotoyot wek i larwa. Konywa pien luker ducu pa jo Amor ma gibedo i lobo godigodi ni gucoke ka monyowa.” <verse eid="JOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Ma omiyo Yocwa oa ki i Gilgal ocito kunu kacel ki lumony ducu ki twoni oteka lweny ducu. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Pe ilwor, pien atyeko miyogi i cingi. Pe tye dano mo ma bicung inyimi.” <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Ci Yocwa orune obino ikomgi oyotoyot, kun oa ki i Gilgal owoto dyewor benebene. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Ci Rwot oonyo atiba lworo ikom jo meno inyim jo Icrael, omiyo gunekogi ki cogi nek madito tutwal i Gibeon; ci guryemo korgi i yoo ma dok tung malo ma kemo Bet-koron, kun kinekogi nio kwede wa i Ajeka ki i Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Ikare ma giringo inyim jo Icrael ma gilor kwede i lung me Bet-koron, Rwot Lubanga ocoro lwak pee madito ikomgi ma oa ki i polo nio kwede wa i Ajeka, ci merok oto mapol. Pee meno oneko lwak merok mapol makato ma jo Icrael onekogi ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Inino ma Rwot omiyo iye jo Amor i cing jo Icrael, Yocwa oloko bot Rwot inyim jo Icrael kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“In ceng, cung mot iwi Gibeon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">ki in dwe, cung i nota me Aijalon.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 1:18">2 Cam 1:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci ceng ocung mot atir, ki dwe bene obedo mot, nio ka jo Icrael guculu kwor ikom lumerokgi. Lok man kicoyo i buk pa Jacar. Ceng ocung mot i dye polo, pe orune me poto woko oyot macok romo nino acel kulu. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Nino mo yam peya obedo kit man nia wa ikare macon nio kwede wa ikare man, ma Rwot owinyo iye dog dano; pien onongo Rwot aye obedo kalweny pi Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Lacen Yocwa ki jo Icrael ducu gudok cen i gony me Gilgal.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Luker meno abic guringo, gukane woko i boro ma inget Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Ci kitito bot Yocwa ni, “Luker abici ki nongogi gukane i boro ma inget Makeda.” <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Ci Yocwa owaco ni, “Wulor dog boro woko ki kidi ma dongo, ci wuket dano gubed cok ka kurugi. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Ento wun pe wubed kunu abeda, wucit wuryem kor lumerokwu, wulweny ikom jo ma odong cen i ngegi, pe dok wuwek gudony i taun gi madito; pien Rwot Lubanga dong otyeko miyogi i cingwu.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Ka Yocwa ki jo Icrael gutyeko neko lukworgi madwong tutwal, nio ka guyweyogi woko ducu, ci jo ma gubwote nongo dong gudonyo woko i taun gi madit ma kicelo ki cel gogo, <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />ci lwak ducu gudok cen bot Yocwa ma onongo en tye i gony i Makeda. Nicake ikare meno, ngat mo pe dong oete kaloko lok mo me lweny ikom jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Yocwa dok owaco ni, “Dong wuyab dog boro woko, ci wukwany luker abici ki i boro, wukelgi bota kany.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Ci gutimo kitmeno; gukwanyo luker abici ki i boro gukelogi bote, rwot me Jerucalem, rwot me Kebron, rwot me Jarmut, rwot me Lakic ki rwot me Eglon. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Ka dong kikwanyo luker ruu woko, ki kelogi bot Yocwa, ci Yocwa olwongo jo Icrael ducu, ci owaco bot ludito mony mayam gucito kwede ni, “Wubin cok, wuket tyenwu i ngut luker abici.” Gubino cok, ci guketo tyen gi i ngutgi. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yocwa dok owaco botgi ni, “Pe wulwor, pe cwinywu opoti; wubed oteka ma cwinywu nwang, pien Rwot bitimo lumerokwu ducu ma wubilwenyo kwedgi kitmeno.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Ka dong Yocwa ocobogi onekogi woko, ka ongabo komgi malo iwi yadi abic, gulyere iwi yadi nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Ento ikare ma ceng dong mito poto, Yocwa ociko, ni kikwanygi woko ki iwi yadi, ci kibologi i boro ma nene gukane iye ni, kiloro dog boro woko ki godi madito ma pud gitye kunu nio wa onyo.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Yocwa omako Makeda inino meno, oneko jo Makeda ki rwotgi ki pala lucwan, ojwerogi woko liweng, pe oweko iye dano mo ma obwot; otimo rwot me Makeda kit mayam otimo kwede rwot me Jerikoni.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Yocwa oa woko ki i Makeda, okato ocito i Libna kacel ki jo Icrael ducu ci gulwenyo ikome. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Rwot dok omiyo taun madit meno kacel ki rwote i cing jo Icrael. Ci guneko jo Libna ducu ki pala lucwan, ikom dano ducu matye iye pe guweko acel mo ma obwot; gutimo rwot ma kunu bene kit ma nene gutimo kwede rwot me Jeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Yocwa oa woko ki i Libna, okato ocito wa i Lakic kacel ki jo Icrael ducu, ci obutu orumu woko liking ka olwenyo ikome. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Rwot omiyo Lakic i cing jo Icrael ci Yocwa omako woko inino me aryone, oneko jo Lakic woko ki pala lucwan, dano matye iye ducu, kit ma nene otimo ikom Libnani.<verse eid="JOS 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Koram rwot me Gejar obino kakonyo jo Lakic, ci Yocwa olwenyo ikome, oneke kacel ki jone ducu, pe oweko dano mo obwot.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Yocwa dok oa woko ki i Lakic okato ocito i Eglon kacel ki jo Icrael ducu; obutu orumu woko liking ci olwenyo ikome. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Gumako woko inino meno, guneko jo Eglon ki pala lucwan, gujwero dano ducu ma gitye iye woko liweng, kit ma nene gutimo ikom Lakic.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Yocwa dok oa woko ki i Eglon, ocito wa i Kebron kacel ki jo Icrael, olwenyo ikome, <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />ci omako woko oneko jo Kebron woko ki pala lucwan kacel ki rwote ki jo ducu matye i taun gi madito ducu ma. Guneko dano ducu matye iye, pe guweko mo acel obwot. Yocwa ojwero woko liweng kacel ki dano ma gitye iye ducu, kit ma nene otimo ikom Eglon.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Yocwa ki jo Icrael ducu guloke gudwogo cen ikom Debir, gulwenyo ikome, <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />gumako woko kacel ki rwote ki taun ducu ma ingete, ci gunekogi woko ki pala lucwan. Yocwa ojwero dano ducu ma gitye iye woko liweng, pe oweko iye dano acel mo ma obwot. En bene otimo Debir ki rwote kit ma nene otimo ikom Kebron ki ikom Libna ki rwote.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Yocwa oloyo lobonu ducu kitmeno, lobo godigodi ki Negeb ki apyel got ki lung ki lukergi ducu, pe oweko gin mo makwo obwot. Ojwero gin makwo woko ducu liweng kit mayam Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael ocikoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yocwa oloyogi cake ki i Kadec-barnea nio kwede wa i Gaja, kacel ki lobo Gocen ducu nio wa i Gibeon. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Omako luker ruu ducu ki lobogi ducu lawangacel, pien Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael aye onongo obedo kalweny pi Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Lacen inge man, Yocwa odok cen kacel ki jo Icrael i gony ma i Gilgal.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yocwa oloyo Jabin ki jo ma oribe kwede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Ka Jabin rwot me Kajor owinyo pi loc pa jo Icrael, ci ocwalo kwena bot Jobab rwot me Madon, ki bot rwot me Cimron ki rwot me Akicap, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />ki bot luker ma gitye tung kumalo i lobo ma obedo godigodi, ki i Araba inget nam me Kinerot matye tung kupiny, ki i lobo ma i apyel, ki i Napot-dor ma tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Ka dok bene ocwalo kwena bot jo Kanaan ma tung kunyango ki tung kupotoceng, ki bot jo Amor, jo Kit, jo Perej, jo Jebuc ma i lobo ma obedo godigodi, ki jo Kiv ma ite got Kermon i lobo Mijpa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Luker magi ducu gubino ki buca monygi ducu, mony madwong ma welgi rom ki kweyo me dog nam, ki lwak aguragura ki gadigadi lweny mapol. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Gutoro monygi ducu kacel, ci gubino gugony kacel inget pii me Merom pi lweny ikom jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Pe lworo omaki ikomgi, pien diki cawa onyo nongo dong amiyogi i cing jo Icrael, nongo dong kinekogi woko ducu. Wubitongo odon aguraguragi ducu, wuwango gadigadi lwenygi woko ki mac.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Yocwa ocito opoto ikomgi atura ki lwak monye ducu ki inget pii me Merom, olwenyo kwedgi. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Ci Rwot omiyogi i cing jo Icrael, gulwenyo ikomgi matek, guryemo korgi nio kwede wa i Cidon Madite ki i Micrepot-maim, tung kupotoceng ki wa i nota me Mijpe tung kunyango kun kinekogi weng ma ngat acel mo pe ma obwot. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yocwa otimogi kit ma nene Rwot ocike kwede. Otongo odon aguraguragi ducu, owango gadigadi lwenygi woko awanga.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Ikare meno rwot me Kajor onongo loyo luker mukene ca ducu, ci Yocwa oloke odok cen kamako Kajor, ci oneko rwote ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Jo Icrael guneko jo ma onongo gitye iye ducu ki pala lucwan, gujwerogi woko liweng, pe guweko gin mo makwo obwot; ci guwango Kajor woko. <verse eid="JOS 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Kitmeno Yocwa omako luker meno ducu, ki taun gi, onekogi woko ki pala lucwan, omedo ki jwerogi woko liweng macalo gin ma kidyero bot Rwot, kit ma Moses latic pa Rwot onongo ocike kwedeni. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Ento jo Icrael pe guwango taun ma kigero iwi lobo ma kitoro malo macalo got, kono Kajor keken aye Yocwa owango woko. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Jo Icrael guyako taun madito meno ducu, gutero lim makwo ki jami ma guyako obedo meggi; ento guneko dano woko ducu ki pala lucwan nio ka gutyekogi woko ducu, pe guweko gin mo makwo obwot. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Kit macalo Rwot yam ociko ki latice Moses, ci Moses bene ociko ki Yocwa kitmeno, ci Yocwa oketgi ducu i tic; otiyo gin ducu mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses, pe oweko cik mo odong ma pe ocobo kakare.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Yocwa omako lobo meno ducu, lobo godigodi, ki Negeb ducu, lobo Gocen, nota ki apyel got. En bene omako Araba ki lobo godigodi kacel ki nota me Jordan ki lobo apyelgu ma ingete. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Ocake ki ikom got Kalak kama lobo otinge odok kwede tung Ceir, nio wa i Baal-gad ma i nota Lebanon ma ite got Kermon. En omako lukergi ducu, ci onekogi woko. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yocwa onongo obedo kalweny ki luker meno pi kare malac. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Pe tye taun madit mo ma oyubu lok me kuc ki jo Icrael, kono nyo jo Kiv ma gibedo i Gibeon keken. Taun madito ducu jo Icrael omakogi ki lweny, <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:16">Nwo 7:16</ref></char></note>pien Rwot aye obedo kamiyo cwinygi obedo tek wek gubin kalweny ikom jo Icrael ka wek kijwergi woko liweng ma pe kica mako dano mo ikomgi, ento kinekgi woko, ma pe mo odong, kit mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Ikare man bene Yocwa ocito kajwero jo Anak woko ki i lobo ma obedo godigodi; ojwerogi ki i Kebron, Debir ki Anab, i lobo godigodi me Juda ki me Icrael; en ojwerogi woko liweng kacel ki taun gi madito ducu. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Pe guweko jo Anak mo obwot, ki i lobo pa jo Icrael; kono nyo ma i Gaja keken ki i Gat ki i Acidod, kunu aye jo Anak mogo gudong iye. <verse eid="JOS 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Yocwa omako lobo ducu kitmeno, kit macalo yam Rwot oloko bot Moses; lacen omiyo bot jo Icrael me bedo lobogi i kakagi, malubu kit ma kwir omakogi kwede, ci lobo dong ocako ywe, ci lweny dong obedo peke.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Luker ma Moses oloyo ki lweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Nwo 2:26—3:11</ref></char>
    </note>Magi aye nying luker ma i lobonu ma jo Icrael guloyogi ci gumako lobogi ma i loka Jordan tung kunyango, ci gucamo odoko meggi, cake wa i kulu Arnon nio kwede wa i got Kermon, kacel ki Araba ducu ma tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Gin aye Cikon rwot pa jo Amor mayam bedo i Kecbon kun loyo kwede lobo ma ocake wa i Aroer matye i dog nota me kulu Arnon, dok cake ki i dye notanu nio kwede i kulu Jabok ma iwang lobo pa jo Ammon, man tye nucu lobo me Gilead; <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />med iye Araba nio wa i nam me Kinerot tung kunyango ki tung yoo mukemo Bet-jecimot nio wa i nam me Araba, ma en aye nam me Kado, cito kwede wa i apyel got Piciga. <verse eid="JOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Ka dok Og rwot me Bacan, en aye ngat acel mayam odong ki ikom jo Repaim, mayam bedo i Acitarot ki i Edrei. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />En yam loyo got Kermon ki Caleka ki Bacan nio kwede wa iwang lobo pa jo Gecur ki jo Maaka, ki nucu lobo Gilead nio wa iwang lobo pa Cikon rwot me Kecbon. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Wel 32:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:12">Nwo 3:12</ref></char></note>Moses ma latic pa Rwot, kacel ki jo Icrael yam oloyogi; ci Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo lobogi bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace obed meggi.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luker ma Yocwa oloyogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Magi aye luker ma i lobonu mayam Yocwa ki jo Icrael guloyogi loka Jordan tung kupotoceng, cake ki i Baal-gad i nota me Lebanon nio wa i got Kalak kama lobo otinge odok kwede tung Ceir, Yocwa omiyo lobogi bot jo Icrael me bedo meggi kun kipoko malubu kwir ma kibolo, <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />i lobo godigodi, ki i lobo ma i nota, i Araba, i lobo ma i apyel got, i tim, i Negeb ki i lobo pa jo Kit, jo Amor, jo Kanaan, jo Periji, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc; nyinggi ene: <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />rwot me Jeriko, rwot me Ai matye inget Betel; <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />rwot me Jerucalem, rwot me Kebron; <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />rwot me Jarmut, rwot me Lakic; <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />rwot me Eglon, rwot me Gejer; <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />rwot me Debir, rwot me Geder; <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />rwot me Korma, rwot me Arad; <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />rwot me Libna, rwot me Adulam; <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />rwot me Makeda, rwot me Betel; <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />rwot me Tapua, rwot me Keper; <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />rwot me Apek, rwot me Apek ma i Caron; <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />rwot me Madon, rwot me Kajor; <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />rwot me Cimron Meron, rwot me Akicap; <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />rwot me Taanak, rwot me Megiddo; <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />rwot me Kedec, rwot me Jokneam ma i Karmel; <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />rwot me Dor ma i Napat-dor, rwot me Goyim ma i Galilaya; <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />ki rwot me Tirja; gin ducu rwodi pyere adek wiye acel.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma odong ma peya kiloyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Ikare ma Yocwa dong otii woko, ma mwaka me dite dong dwong, Rwot owaco bote ni, “In dong itii woko ma mwaka me diti dong dwong, ento pud lobo odong mabup ma myero obed mewu. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Magi aye nying lobo ma pud gudong: lobo pa jo Piliciti ducu ki bere, ki lobo pa jo Gecur ducu. <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />(Lobo meno ducu kikwano ni pa jo Kanaan, cake wa i Cikor ma inget Ejipt tung kunyango dok kwede i tung malo wa iwang lobo me Ekron; matye ite loc pa rwodi abic pa jo Piliciti, rwodi me Gaja, Acidod, Acikelon, Gat ki Ekron.) Pud odong lobo ducu pa jo Ayim bene matye <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />tung kupiny; ka dok lobo ducu pa jo Kanaan cake ki i Me-ara pa jo Cidon cito kwede wa i Apek ma iwang lobo pa jo Amor; <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />ki lobo pa jo Gebal, ki Lebanon ducu ma tung kunyango, cake ki i Baal-gad ma ite got Kermon nio kwede i yoo madonyo i Kamat. <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:54">Wel 33:54</ref></char></note>Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni an kikoma aye abiryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael, gin aye jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo godi, cake ki i Lebanon nio kwede i Micrepot-maim, ma gin en aye jo Cidon ducu. Ci in aye i pok loboni bot jo Icrael kun i bolo kwir wek obed lobogi, kit mayam aciki kwedeni. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Kombedi dong i pok lobo man obed me ginaleya pa kaka abongwen mudong ki pa nucu kaka pa Manace.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poko lobo loka Jordan ma tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 32:33">Wel 32:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:12">Nwo 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>Nucu kaka mukene pa jo Manace, kacel ki jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad onongo dong gutyeko gamo lobogi ki i loka Jordan tung kunyango, kit macalo Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo botgi, <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />cake ki i Aroer matye i dog nota me kulu Arnon ki taun madit matye i dye notanu, kacel ki abami me Medema nio wa i Dibon; <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />ki taun madito ducu pa Cikon rwot pa jo Amor mayam obedo kaloc i Kecbon nio kwede iwang apoki lobo pa jo Ammon; <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />ki lobo Gilead bene, ki lobo pa jo Gecur ki jo Maaka, got Kermon ducu, ki lobo Bacan ducu nio wa i Caleka; <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />ki ker ducu pa Og ma gang kale yam gubedo Acitarot ki Edrei i lobo Bacan. En kene aye yam odong ki ikin jo Repaim; rwodi aryonu Moses oloyogi, ci oryemogi woko. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Ento jo Icrael pe guryemo jo Gecur ki jo Maaka; jo Gecur ki jo Maaka pud gibedo i dye jo Icrael nio wa onyo.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:1">Nwo 18:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kaka pa Levi keken aye Moses pe omiyo botgi lobo mo me aleya; gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael aye gubedo ma ka lobogi, kit ma Rwot yam owaco boteni.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaka pa Reuben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Moses yam omiyo lobo bot kaka pa jo pa Reuben ma oporo dogolagi ducu. <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Pieno wang lobogi ocake ki i Aroer matye i dog nota kulu Arnon, ki taun madit matye i dye notanu, okwako lobo matye apyelapyel ducu ma orabo nget Medeba; <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />kacel ki Kecbon ki taun ducu ma guryeyo wi abami kunu, Dibon, Bamot-Baal, Bet-baalmeon, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Jakaj, Kedemot, Mepat, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriataim, Cibma, Jeret-cakar ma kigero iwi got ma i dye nota, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Bet-peor, apyel got Piciga, ki Bet-jecimot, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />meno aye taun ducu ma gitye iwi apyel, ki ker ducu pa Cikon rwot pa jo Amor ma gang kale yam tye i Kecbon, mayam Moses olwenyo kwede oloyo woko, kacel ki ludito pa jo Midian ma gubedo i lobonu ite loc pa Cikon; nyinggi aye Eyi, Rekem, Jur, Kur ki Reba. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Balaam wod pa Beor bene, ma latyet, obedo ikin jo ma jo Icrael gunekogi ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Kulu Jordan obedo wang lobo pa jo Reuben. Meno aye obedo lobo pa jo pa Reuben ma oporo wel dogolagi, meno aye taun gi madito ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaka pa Gad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Moses omiyo lobo bot jo pa Gad bene ma oporo wel dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Lobogi obedo Jajer ki taun madito me lobo Gilead ducu, ki nucu lobo pa jo Ammon nio wa i Aroer matye inget Raba, tung kunyango. <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />Cake ki i Kecbon cito kwede wa i Ramat-mijpe ki Betonim, dok cake ki i Makanaim cito kwede iwang lobo me Lo-debar, <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />kacel ki Bet-aram, Bet-nimra, Cukot ki Japon, taun madito ma i nota, en aye lobo mudong ki ikom ker pa Cikon rwot me Kecbon. Wang lobogi obedo kulu Jordan ocito kwede wa i but nam me Kineret tung kumalo, loka Jordan ma dok tung kunyango. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Meno aye obedo lobo ginaleya pa jo pa Gad ma oporo wel dogolagi, meno aye taun gi madito ki taun gi matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nucu kaka pa Manace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Moses omiyo lobo bot nucu kaka pa Manace bene; en opoko bot nucu kaka pa Manace ma oporo wel dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Lobogi ocake ki i Makanaim, okwako lobo Bacan ducu, en aye ker pa Og rwot me Bacan ducu liweng, ki gangi me Jair ducu ma gitye i Bacan, gangi pyere abicel, <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />ki nucu lobo Gilead, kacel ki Acitarot ki Edrei ma gin aye gangkal pa Og i lobo Bacan. Meno ducu kipoko bot jo pa Makir wod pa Manace, pi nucu kaka pa jo Makir ma oporo wel dogolagi.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Meno aye lobo mayam Moses opoko i lobo aroo me Moab ma loka Jordan tung kunyango mukemo Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Wel 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:2">Nwo 18:2</ref></char></note>Ento ki tung bot jo Levi, Moses pe omiyogi lobo mo; onongo Rwot Lubangagi aye obedo ginaleyagi, kit mayam owaco botgini.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Poko lobo matung kupotoceng me Jordan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Magi aye lobo ma jo Icrael gulimo ki i lobo Kanaan, ma jo magi aye gupoko botgi: ajwaka Eleajar, Yocwa wod pa Nun ki ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:52-56">Wel 26:52-56</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 34:13">34:13</ref></char></note> Gupoko lobo me ginaleyagi ki bolo kwir kit mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses ni myero kipok kwede bot kaka abongwen ki nucu ma odongi. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Wel 32:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 34:14-15">34:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:12-17">Nwo 3:12-17</ref></char></note>Moses onongo yam opoko lobo aleya bot kaka aryo ki nucu ki i loka Jordan. Jo Levi keken aye pe kimiyo botgi lobo mo me aleyagi. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Likwayo pa Yucepu onongo gupoke i kaka aryo, jo Manace ki jo Epraim; ento pe kimiyo dul lobo mo bot jo Levi me aleyagi; kimiyogi taun madito me bedogi keken ki olet me kwayo dyangigi ki limgi mukene makwo. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Jo Icrael gupoko lobo ikin gi kun gitiyo kit ma onongo Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimiyo Kebron bot Kaleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:30">Wel 14:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno jo pa Juda gubino bot Yocwa i Gilgal, ci Kaleb wod pe Jepune ma jo Keniji owaco bote ni, “In ingeyo gin mayam Rwot ociko bot Moses ma dano pa Lubangani, ma ociko ki i Kadec-barnea, lok ma dok ikomi ki ikoma. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:1-30">Wel 13:1-30</ref></char></note>Onongo dong mwaka me dita romo pyere angwen ikare ma Moses latic pa Lubanga ocwala ki i Kadec-barnea pi roto lobo, ci adwogo ki lok kit mayam tye kwede i cwinya. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Utmegiwa mayam gucito kwedani gumiyo cwiny lwak ongabe angaba, ento an yam alubu gin ma Rwot Lubangana mito ducu kikore. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:24">Wel 14:24</ref></char></note>Moses okwongo kwong inino meno kun waco ni, ‘Adada, lobo mayam i nyono ki tyeni bibedo ginaleyani ki pa likwayi matwal, pien ibedo kalubu gin ma Rwot Lubangana omito ki cwinyi ducu.’ <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Kombedi nen ka Rwot pud ogwoka atye makwo wa onyo kit mayam owaconi, dong odoko mwaka pyere angwen wiye abic nia kwede wa ikare ca ma Rwot owaco iye lok man bot Moses, ma onongo jo Icrael pud gitye kawire i tim kuca; kombedi dong inen, mwaka me dita dong oromo pyere aboro wiye abic. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Ento koma pud tek wa ikare man marom ki ikare mayam Moses ocwala kwede ca; i kareni tek koma pud rom ki tek koma macon ca, pud aromo lweny, aromo cito ka moni ci adwogo bene. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Pieno miya loboni ma obedo lobo godi, mayam Rwot owaco pire ikare ca. Yam iwinyo ikare meno ni jo Anak gitye kunu kun gitye ki cog taun madito ma kirumugi woko ki cel matego; ka gwok nyo Rwot bibedo kweda ci abiryemogi woko kit macalo Rwot yam owaco.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Ci Yocwa olamo gum ikome, ci omiyo Kebron bot Kaleb wod pa Jepune wek obed ginaleyane. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Kitmeno Kebron odoko lobo pa likwayo pa Kaleb wod pa Jepune ma jo Keniji nio wa onyo, pien obedo kalubu gin ma Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael mito ducu kikore. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Nying Kebron okwongo bedo Kiriat-arba. (Arba yam obedo dano madit makato ducu ki ikin jo Anak.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Ci lobo dong oywe, lweny obedo peke.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Dul lobo ma kipoko bot kaka pa Juda kibolo kwir ma oporo dogolagi obedo tung kupiny macok ki wang lobo pa jo Edom, i tim Jin ci ogik i Negeb tung kupiny. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Wang lobogi matye tung kupiny ocake i agiki Nam me Kado ki i acol nam ma okemo tung kupiny; <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />ka dok ocito kwede tung kupiny kama ki ito iye malo i Akrabim, ka okato wa i Jin, ocito kwede malo inget Kadec-barnea tung kupiny, orabo nget Kejeron nio wa i Adar, ka dok oloke odok kwede tung Karka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Ka dok okato ocito i Ajimon, oo i nota ora me Ejipt, ka ogik i dog Nam Mediterranean. Meno aye wang lobogi tung kupiny.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Wang lobogi tung kunyango aye Nam me Kado nio kama kulu Jordan gik iye. Wang lobo tung kupiny ocake i acol nam kama Jordan ogik iye, <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />ka dok cito Bet-kogla, kato kwede inget Bet-araba tung kumalo, nio wa i got ma Boan wod pa Reuben ocibo. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Ka dok cito malo i Debir kun oa ki i nota me Akor, kemo kwede tung kumalo, ka dong loke kemo Gilgal ma inyim kor got kama ki ito iye malo i Adumim ma inget nota ora tung kupiny. Ka dong kato cito wa i pii me En-cemec ci gik kwede i En-rogel. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Ki kunu wang lobo lubu nota pa wod pa Kinom i kor got pa jo Jebuc tung kupiny kama taun madit me Jerucalem tye iye. Ka dok wang lobo cito malo iwi got ma okemo nota pa Kinom tung kupotoceng, i agiki lung me Repaim tung kupiny. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Omede kun a ki iwi got cito iwang pii me Neputoa, kato kwede wa i taun madito ma i got Epron, ci loke mano tung Baala (en aye Kiriat-jearim). <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Ka dong oa ki i Baala ci gono cito kun kemo tung kupotoceng nio kwede i got Ceir, kato kwede i kor got Jearim tung kumalo (en aye Kecalon). Ka dok lunge cito piny i Bet-cemec, kato kwede inget Timna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Wang lobo a ki kunu cito i kor got ma inget Ekron tung kumalo, ka dok loke cito Cikeron, kato kwede wa i got Baala, cito i Jabneel; ka dok gik woko i dog Nam Mediterranean. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Wang lobo tung kupotoceng lubu dog Nam Mediterranean ki wang wate. Meno aye wang lobo ducu ma okwako lobo pa jo pa Juda ma oporo dogolagi.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaleb oloyo Kebron ki Debir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JDG 1:10-15">Lung 1:10-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:20">Lung 1:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kaleb wod pa Jepune yam kimiyo dul lobo ikin jo pa Juda, kit ma onongo Rwot ociko ki Yocwa. Yocwa omiye taun madit Kiriat-arba, ma en aye Kebron, ma obedo pa Arba. Arba obedo kwaro pa jo Anak. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Ci Kaleb oryemo likwayo adek pa Anak mayam tye kunu, gin aye Cecai, Akiman ki Talmai. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Kaleb oa ki kunu ocito olwenyo ikom jo ma gibedo Debir. Nying Debir yam obedo Kiriat-ceper. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Ci Kaleb owaco ni, “Ka ngat mo olwenyo ikom Kiriat-ceper ce oloyo, ci abimiye nyara Akaca obed dakone.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Otiniel wod pa Kenaj omin Kaleb aye oloyo, ci Kaleb omiye nyare Akaca obedo dakone. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Inino ma Otiniel onyomo Akaca, Otiniel odiye ni openy poto mo bot wone. Akaca opye piny ki iwi kanane ci Kaleb openye ni, “I mito gin ango nyara?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Ci nyare ogamo ni, “Miya mot mo do. Macalo dong iketa wa i lobo Negeb, dok imiya wang it mo bene.” Kaleb omiye wang it ma kumalo ki wang it ma kupiny bene.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taun madito pa jo pa Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Man aye lobo pa jo me kaka pa Juda ma oporo dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Taun gi madito ma obedo kama lobogi ogik iye tung kupiny i Negeb, ma dok tung wang lobo pa jo Edom gin ene: Kabeel, Eder, Jagur, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedec, Kajor, Itnan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Jip, Telem, Bealot, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Kajor-kadata, Keriot-kejeron, ma en aye Kajor, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amam, Cema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Kajar-gada, Kecmon, Betpelet, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Kajar-cual, Beer-ceba, Bijiotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baala, Iyim, Ejem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Eltolad, Kecil, Korma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Jiklag, Madmana, Cancana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebaot, Cilim, Ain ki Rimmon; gin ducu taun madito pyere aryo ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Taun gi madito ma obedo i apyel gin ene: Ectaol, Jora, Acna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Janoa, En-ganim, Tapua, Enam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Jarmut, Adulam, Coko, Ajeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Caaraim, Aditaim, Gedera, ki Gederotaim; taun apar wiye angwen ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Jenan, Kadaca, Migdal-gad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dilean, Mijpe, Jokteel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakic, Bojkat, Eglon, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabon, Lamam. Kitlic, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederot, Bet-dagon, Naama ki Makeda; taun madito apar wiye abicel ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libna, Eter, Acan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ipta, Acna, Nejib, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila, Akijib ki Mareca; taun madito abongwen ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ekron ki taun ki gangi ma ingete; <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />cake ki i Ekton cito kwede i dog Nam Mediterranean ki taun madito ducu matye tung Acidod ki gangi matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Acidod kacel ki taun ki gangi ma ingete; Gaja ki taun ki gangi ma ingete cito wa i nota ora me Ejipt ki Nam Mediterranean ki wang wate.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />I lobo godi onongo tye, Camir, Jatir, Coko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana, Kiriat-cana, en aye Debir, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anab, Ectemo, Anim, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gocen, Kolon ki Gilo; taun madito apar wiye acel ki taun ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Arab, Duma, Eean, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Janim, Bettapua, Apeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Kumta, Kiriat-arba, en aye Kebron, ki Jior; taun madito abongwen ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Maon, Karmel, Jip, Juta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Jejreel, Jokdeam, Janoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kain, Gibea ki Timna; taun madito apar ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Kalkul, Bet-jur, Gedor, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maarat, Bet-anot ki Eltekon; taun madito abicel ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiriat-baal, en aye Kiriat-jearim, ki Raba; taun madito aryo ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Taun madito matye i dye tim gin aye, Bet-araba, Midin, Cekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibcan, Taun madit me Kado, ki En-gedi; taun madito abicel ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:63: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Lung 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:6">2 Cam 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 11:4">1 Tek 11:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ento jo Jebuc, ma gin aye jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem, jo Juda pe guryemogi woko ki i lobogi, ma omiyo jo Jebuc gunywako bedo kacel ki jo Juda i Jerucalem nio kwede wa onyo.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Epraim ki jo pa Manace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Wang lobo pa likwayo pa Yucepu ma kipoko ki bolo kwir ocake ki i kulu Jordan inget Jeriko, oweko pii me Jeriko odong tung kunyango, ocito tung tim, kun oa ki i Jeriko cito wa i lobo godi me Betel. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Oa ki i Betel ocito Luj, ka okato ocito Atarot ma i lobo pa jo Arki; <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />ka dok okato kwede tung piny ma tung kupotoceng, i lobo pa jo Japuleti, oo i lobo ma inget Bet-koron Mapiny, ocito Gejer, ka ogik kwede i Nam Mediterranean. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Meno aye obedo lobo pa likwayo pa Yucepu, jo pa Manace ki jo pa Epraim.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lobo pa jo pa Epraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Lobo pa jo pa Epraim ma oporo dogolagi obedo kit man: wang lobogi ma tung kunyango ocake i Atarot-adar ocito kwede i Bet-koron Mamalo. <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />Oa ki kunu okemo tung Nam Mediterranean, oo i Mikmetat tung kumalo; ka dok oloke okemo Taanat-eilo tung kunyango, orabo ngete okato kun weko Janea bene tung kunyango. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Ka dok oa ki inget Janoa ocito Atarot ki Naara, ogudu Jeriko, ocito ogik kwede i kulu Jordan <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Wang lobo dok ocake ki Tapua okemo tung kupotoceng o kwede i nota ora ma nyinge Kana ka ogik kwede i Nam Mediterranean. Meno aye lobo pa jo Epraim ma oporo wel dogolagi, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />kacel ki taun ki gangi mogo ma kikoyo pi jo Epraim i dye lobo pa jo Manace, taun meno ducu ki gangi ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:29">Lung 1:29</ref></char></note>Ento jo Epraim pe guryemo jo Kanaan woko ma gibedo i Gejer, ma omiyo jo Kanaan gibedo i dye jo Epraim nio wa onyo, ento gudoko opiigi me tiyo tic matek.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Jo pa Manace ma tung kupotoceng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Dok kibolo kwir me poko dul lobo pa jo pa Manace, pien en aye latin kayo pa Yucepu. Yam onongo kimiyo Gilead ki Bacan bot Makir won Gilead, latin kayo pa Manace, pien onongo en lalweny. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Ka dok kibolo kwir pi poko lobo bot jo me kaka pa Manace ma pud odong ma oporo dogolagi ducu, dogola pa Abiejer, Kelek, Aciriel, Cekem, Keper ki Cemida; gin aye likwayo ma co pa Manace wod pa Yucepu.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Jelopekad wod pa Keper onywalo anyira keken, awobene onongo pe. Nying anyirane Makala, Noa, Kogla, Milka ki Tirja. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:1-7">Wel 27:1-7</ref></char></note>Gin gubino inyim ajwaka Eleajar ki Yocwa wod pa Nun, ci guwaco ni, “Rwot yam ociko Moses ni myero kimii lobo botwa kacel ki utmegiwa.” Ma omiyo Yocwa omiyogi lobo kacel ki omegi won gi, kit ma Rwot onongo ocikoni. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Kitmeno jo pa Manace gugamo dul lobo apar medo ikom Gilead ki Bacan ma loka Jordan tung kunyango, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />pien anyira pa Manace bene dok gulimo lobo kacel ki awobene. Lobo Gilead onongo dong ki miyo bot likwayo mukene pa Manace.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Wang lobo pa jo Manace ocake ki i Acer ocito kwede Mikmetat matye tung kunyango me Cekem. Ka dok ocito tung kupiny nio kwede En-tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Lobo Tapua obedo bot jo pa Manace, ento taun Tapua kikome ma iwang lobo pa jo pa Manace onongo kimiyo bot jo Epraim. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Wang lobo dok ocito wa i nota ora Kana. Taun madito matye kunu inget kulunu tung kupiny kimiyogi bot jo pa Epraim, kadi bed gitye i ite loc pa jo pa Manace. Wang lobo pa jo pa Manace orabo nget kulunu tung kumalo ocito kwede i Nam Mediterranean. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Lobo ma tung kupiny obedo pa jo pa Epraim ki lobo ma tung kumalo obedo pa jo Manace, kun Nam Mediterranean aye obedo wang lobogi tung kupotoceng. Lobo pa jo pa Manace orwate ki lobo pa jo Acer tung kumalo, ki tung kunyango orwate ki lobo pa jo Icakar. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Ento i lobo pa jo Icakar ki jo Acer, jo pa Manace gubedo ki taun magi: Bet-cean ki taun matino ma ingete, ki Ibleam ki taun matino ma ingete; kimiyogi bene dano ma gibedo i Dor ki En-dor ki i taun matino ma ingetgi, ki dano ma gibedo i Taanak ki Megiddo ki i taun matino ma ingetgi. (Me adeke obedo Napat). <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:27-28">Lung 1:27-28</ref></char></note>Ento gamo taun madito meno wek oloke odok meggi oloyo jo pa Manace woko; ci jo Kanaan gucere gumedo ki bedo i lobo kunu. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Ento lacen ka jo Icrael gudoko tek, guketogi i tic muroni, pe guryemogi woko ducu liweng.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Kaka pa Yucepu guloko bot Yocwa kun giwaco ni, “Pingo imiyo kibolo kwir pirwa tyen acel keken, ma omiyo walimo dul lobo acel keken me bedo ginaleyawa? Wan watye ki lwak dano madwong mada, macalo Rwot dong obedo kamiyowa gum nio wa onyo.” <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yocwa ogamo ni, “Ka wutye ki lwak dano mapol, ci wucit i bunga wujwer dul lobo mo ma i lobo pa jo Perej ki jo Repaim, kit macalo lobo godi pa jo pa Epraim pe romo wuni.” <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Ento jo me kaka pa Yucepu gugamo ni, “Lobo godi pe biromowa; dok bene jo Kanaan ma gibedo i bar gitye ki gadigadi nyonyo me lweny, gin jo ma gibedo i Bet-cean ki i taun matino ma ingete ki gin ma gibedo i nota me Jejreel bene.” <verse eid="JOS 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Yocwa dok owaco bot likwayo pa Yucepu, jo pa Epraim ki jo pa Manace ni, “Wun wutye ki lwak dano madwong mada, dok wutye ki tek madwong bene; pieno pe wubibedo ki dul lobo acel keken. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />Lobo godi aye bibedo mewu, kadi obedo bunga; wubijwero woko wucamo doko mewu nio kwede wa i agiki wang lobo; pien wubiryemo jo Kanaan woko, kadi bed gitye ki gadigadi nyonyo me lweny, dok kadi bed gin jo matego.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko ki i Cilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Lacen jo Icrael gucoke i Cilo, ci guguru Kema me Rwate kunu. Onongo dong gutyeko loyo lobo woko ducu, <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />ento pud odong kaka abiro ma peya kipoko dul lobo mo botgi me aleyagi.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Ma omiyo Yocwa owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Wubibedo kajunge nio kwede wa awene ma pe wucito kacamo lobo ma Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu dong omiyo botwuni? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Wukwany dano adek ki i kaka acel acel wek gucit guwire i loboni ducu, guco lok ikome kun gipo ni bibedo lobo me ginaleya pa kakagi, ka dok gudwog bota. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Myero kipok lobo i dul abiro, kun nongo jo Juda pud bimede ki bedo i lobogi ma tung kupiny, ki jo pa Yucepu bene bibedo i meggi ma tung kumalo. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Wubicoyo lok ikom lobo kun wunyutu kit ma lobone tye kwede ikom lobo abironu ducu, ci wukel gin ma wucoyoni bota, ci abibolo kwir pirwu kany inyim Rwot Lubangawa. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Jo pa Levi pe bilimo dul lobo mo ikinwu, pien ginaleyagi aye ticgi me bedo ajwaki pa Rwot; dok jo Gad, jo Reuben ki nucu kaka pa Manace gutyeko limo lobogi loka Jordan tung kunyango, ma Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo botgi.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Jo meno ma gucito kacoyo lok ikom lobo gucako wotgi, ci Yocwa ocikogi kun waco ni, “Wucit wuwot wurum lobo kaweng kun wucoyo kit ma loboni tye kwede ducu, ka wudwog bota; ci abibolo kwir pirwu kany i Cilo ki inyim Rwot.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Ci jonu gucito kawot i lobonu, kun gicoyo lok ikom taun acel acel i buk malubu dul lobo abiro ma gupoko iye. Lacen gudwogo bot Yocwa i gony ma i Cilo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Ci Yocwa obolo kwir pirgi i Cilo ki inyim Rwot. Opoko lobo bot jo Icrael ki kunu, kun kaka acel acel limo dul lobone.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Dul lobo ma kwir okwanyo pi kaka pa Benjamin ma oporo dogolagi obedo kit man: lobo ma kimiyo botgi obedo ikin lobo me kaka pa Juda ki me kaka pa Yucepu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Ki tung kumalo wang lobogi ocake ikom kulu Jordan, ka ocito malo wa i kor got ma inget Jeriko tung kumalo, ka ocito kwede obaro kin lobo godi ma tung kupotoceng, ka ogik kwede i tim me Bet-aven. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Ki kunu wang lobogi ocito tung kupiny kun kemo Luj nio wa i kor got ma inget Luj (en aye Betel), ka dong ocito Atarot-adar, kun wok ki iwi got matye inget Bet-koron Mapiny tung kupiny. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Ka dok wang lobo oloke omano nge got ma okemo Bet-koron tung kupiny kun kato ki inget got cito kemo tung kupiny nio kwede i Kiriat-baal, ma en aye Kiriat-jearim, ma taun madit pa kaka pa Juda. Meno aye wang lobo ma tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Ki tung kupiny wang lobo ocake ki i agiki gang Kiriat-jearim ocito kwede tung piny nio iwang pii me Neputoa; <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />ka dok ocito iwang agiki got ma okemo nota pa wod pa Kinom matye i agiki nota me Repaim tung kumalo. Ka dok ocito piny kun lubu nota pa Kinom ma inget kor got pa jo Jebuc tung kupiny nio kwede En-rogel. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Ka dok oloke odok tung kumalo wa i En-cemec. Ki kunu dok ocito Gelilot ma inyim kor got kama ki ito iye malo i Adumim; ka dok cito i got ma Boan wod pa Reuben ocibo, <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />ka okato kwede ocito tung kumalo ma orabo kwede kor got me Bet-araba, ocito wa i Araba. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Ka dok orabo nget kor got me Bet-kogla kun wok tung kumalo, ocito ogik i jang Nam me Kado ma i but nam tung kumalo kama kulu Jordan donyo ki iye. Meno aye wang lobo tung kupiny. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Kulu Jordan aye obedo wang lobogi tung kunyango. Meno aye lobo pa jo pa Benjamin ma oporo dogolagi, ki wang lobo ducu ma okwako lobogi.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Taun madito pa jo pa Benjamin ma oporo dogolagi gin ene; Jeriko, Bet-kogla, Emek-kejij, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Bet-araba. Jemaraim, Betel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Avim, Para, Opra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kepar-ammoni, Opni, Geba, gin ducu taun madito apar wiye aryo ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Gibeon, Rama, Beerot, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Mijpe, Kepira, Moja, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekem, Irpeel, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Jela, Elep, Jebuc, ma en aye Jerucalem, Gibea ki Kiriat-jearim, taun madito apar wiye angwen ki taun matino ma ingetgi. Meno aye lobo pa jo pa Benjamin ma oporo dogolagi ducu.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Cimeon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Kwir ma kibolo me aryone opoto ikom Cimeon, pi kaka pa jo pa Cimeon ma oporo dogolagi; lobogi obedo i dye lobo ma kimiyo bot jo me kaka pa Juda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 4:28-33">1 Tek 4:28-33</ref></char></note> Lobo pa jo pa Cimeon okwako taun magi: Beer-ceba, Ceba, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Kajar-cual, Bala, Ejem, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Eltolad, Betul, Korma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Jiklag, Bet-markabot, Kajar-cuca, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Bet-lebaot ki Caruken, taun madito apar wiye adek ki taun matino ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Ain, Rimmon, Eter, ki Acan, taun madito angwen ki taun matino ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Magi ducu kacel ki lwak taun ducu ma orumu nget taun madito nio wa Baalat-beer, ma kilwongo bene ni Rama me Negeb. Meno aye obedo lobo pa jo pa Cimeon ma oporo dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Lobo pa jo pa Cimeon obedo dul lobo ma kipoko ki ikom lobo pa jo pa Juda; onongo dul lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Juda obedo lac mada ma obwoyo komgi woko, ma omiyo jo pa Cimeon gulimo lobogi i dyegi.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Jabulon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Kwir ma kibolo me adeke opoto ikom kaka pa jo pa Jabulon ma oporo dogolagi ducu, ci lobo ma guleyo oo wa i Carid. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Ki kunu wang lobogi owoto tung kupotoceng oo wa i Mareal, ka ogudu kwede Dabecet ki nota ora matye tung kunyango me Jokneam. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Cake ki i Carid bene wang lobone mukene mukemo kunyango ma tung kunyango ocito oo wa iwang lobo me Kiclot Tabor, <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />ka ocito kwede wa Dabera, ka oo i Japia. Ka oa ki kunu okato tung kunyango oo kwede Gat-keper ki Etkajin, ka ocito Rimmon ci oloke odok Nea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Wang lobo ki tung kumalo ogom woko ocito Kanaton ci ogik i nota Iptakel. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Mede ikom meno gubedo ki taun madito magi: Katat, Nakalal, Cimron, Idala ki Beterekem; taun madito apar wiye aryo ki taun matino ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Meno aye lobo pa jo Jabulon ma oporo dogolagi, taun madito ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Icakar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Kwir ma kibolo me angwene opoto ikom Icakar pi kaka pa jo pa Icakar ma oporo dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />I lobogi onongo tye iye taun magi: Jejreel, Keculot, Cunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Kaparaim, Sion, Anakarat, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabit, Kicion, Ebej, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remet, En-ganim, En-kada, Bet-pajej. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Wang lobogi ogudu Tabor bene, Cakajuma ki Bet-cemec, ci ogik i kulu Jordan. Taun magi madito ducu obedo apar wiye abicel, ki taun matino ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Meno aye lobo pa jo Icakar ma oporo dogolagi, taun magi madito ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Acer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Kwir ma kibolo me abice opoto ikom kaka pa jo pa Acer ma oporo dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Lobogi onongo tye iye taun magi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 19:25">Kelkat, Kali, Beten, Akicap, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alam melek, Amad ki Mical. Wang lobogi ogudu Karmel tung kupotoceng, ki Cikor-libnat. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Kikenyo oloke odok tung kunyango ocito Bet-dagon, ci ogudu lobo pa jo Jabulon ki nota Iptakel tung kumalo i Bet-emek ki Neiel. Wang lobo ma tung kumalo ocito Kabul, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Ebron, Rekob, Kamon ki Kana ci oo wa i Cidon Madite. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Kikenyo wang lobo oloke ocito Rama oo kwede Turo ma kicelo ki cel gogoni, ci oloke ocito Koca ka ogik i dog Nam Mediterranean. Taun gi mukene obedo Makalab, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Umma, Apek ki Rekob, ducu taun madito pyere aryo wiye aryo ki taun matino ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Meno aye lobo pa jo pa Acer ma oporo dogolagi, taun gi madito magi ki taun matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Naputali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Kwir ma kibolo me abicel opoto ikom kaka pa jo pa Naputali ma oporo dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Wang lobogi ocake i Kelep ite yat kworo ma i Jaananim owok ki i Adami-nekeb ki Jabneel, ocito wa i Lakun ka ogik kwede i kulu Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Ki kunu wang lobo oloke okemo tung kupotoceng ocito Ajinot-tabor, oa ki kunu ocito Kukok; kumeno ogudu lobo pa jo pa Jabulon tung kupiny, lobo pa jo pa Acer tung kupotoceng ki kulu Jordan tung kunyango. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Taun gi madito ma kicelo ki cel gogo obedo Jidim, Jer, Kammat, Rakat, Kineret, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama, Rama, Kajor, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedec, Edrei, En-kajor, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yiron, Migdalel, Korem, Bet-anat ki Bet-cemec: Taun gi madito ducu obedo apar wiye abongwen ki taun matino ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Meno aye lobo pa jo Naputali ma oporo dogolagi, taun gi madito kacel ki taun gi matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko bot jo pa Dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Kwir, ma kibolo me abiro opoto ikom kaka pa jo pa Dan ma oporo dogolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />I lobo me ginaleyagi onongo tye iye taun madito magi: Jora, Ectaol, Ir-cemec, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Caalahin, Aijalon, Itla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Elon, Timna, Ekron, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Elteke, Gibeton, Baalat, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Jekud, Bene-barak, Gat-rimmon, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Mejarkon ki Rakon ki lobo ma inyim Jopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:27-29">Lung 18:27-29</ref></char></note>Ento ka lobo pa jo pa Dan orwenyo woko ki i cinggi pien camone oloyogi, ci gucito gulwenyo ikom taun madit mo ma nyinge Lecem, gumayo dok guneko dano ma gibedo iye woko ducu ki pala lucwan, ka guloko taun madit meno odoko meggi, ci gucako bedo iye. Guloko nying Lecem gucako ni, Dan macalo nying kwarogi Dan. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Meno aye lobo pa jo pa Dan ma oporo dogolagi, taun gi madito magi ki taun gi matino ma ingetgi.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kimiyo bot Yocwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Ka dong gutyeko poko lobo i dul mapatpat me bedo lobogi, ci jo Icrael gumiyo dul lobo mo bot Yocwa wod pa Nun me bedo ginaleyane ikin gi. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Gumiyo bote taun madito ma en olego ki botgi kit ma Rwot ocikogi kwede, en aye Timnat-cera ma i lobo godi pa jo pa Epraim. En dok ogero gange odoco ci obedo iye.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Meno aye lobo ma ajwaka Eleajar ki Yocwa ki ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi gupoko bot jo Icrael i Cilo inyim Rwot i dogola Kema me Rwate kun kibolo iye kwir; ci gutyeko poko lobo kitmeno.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">Taun madito me laro lunek dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Wel 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:41-43">Nwo 4:41-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">19:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Wel 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:41-43">Nwo 4:41-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">19:1-13</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot dok owaco bot Yocwa ni, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ‘Wuyer taun madito me laro lunek dano mayam aloko pirgi botwu ki i dog Moses. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Wek lunek ma pe guneko dano akaka, nyo ma pe gupiro pi nekogi apira, guring gular iye komgi. Taun gi madito magi bibedo me laro lanek dano ki bot lacul kwor remo. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Lanek biringo laro taun madit mo keken ki ikin gi, ci bicung inyim ludito me dog cel me taun madit meno ma kidonyo kwedeni wek otit loke botgi. Ka gin bitero en wa i taun madit, ci gibimiye kabedo mo, ci en bibedo kwedgi kunu. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Kace wat macok pa lato ma lacul kwor remoni olubu kore, pe kibimiyo lanek meno i cinge, pien pe oneko lawote ma onongo opiro pi nekone apira, dok onongo en yam peke ki kit mone mo ikome ikare macon ca. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />En bibedo i taun madit meno nio ka bicung inyim kacoke wek kingol kope, ci bikuru nio wa ikare ma ajwaka madit ma onongo tye katic ikare meno otyeko to. Lacen en twero dok i taun ma tuggi kikome, kama yam en oa ki iye ikare ma oringo olaro komeni.’”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Ci jo Icrael guyero taun madito magi tung kupotoceng me kulu Jordan, ci gukwerogi pi tic man: Kedec ma i Galilaya i lobo godi pa jo pa Naputali, Cekem i lobo godi pa jo pa Epraim, ki Kiriat-arba, en aye Kebron, i lobo godi pa jo pa Juda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Ki loka Jordan ma inge Jeriko tung kunyango guyero Bejer ma i tim ma obedo cerecere i lobo pa jo pa Reuben, Ramot ma i Gilead i lobo pa jo pa Gad, ki Golan ma i Bacan i lobo pa jo pa Manace. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Meno aye taun madito ma kiyerogi pi kaka pa jo Icrael ducu kacel ki welo ma lubedo ikin gi, wek lanek dano ma pe oneko akaka oring olar iye kome, wek pe oto i cing lacul kwor remo nio wang ma opido inyim lwak.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">Taun Madito pa Lulevi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:1-8">Wel 35:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 6:54-81">1 Tek 6:54-81</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Ludito wi kaka pa kwaro pa Lulevi gubino bot ajwaka Eleajar ki Yocwa wod pa Nun ki ludito wi kaka pa jo Icrael mukene ducu. <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:1-8">Wel 35:1-8</ref></char></note>Gubino botgi i Cilo i lobo Kanaan, ci guwaco botgi ni, “Rwot yam ociko ki i dog Moses ni myero kimii botwa taun madito me bedowa kacel ki lobo ma ingetgi me oletgu pi kwayo leewa makwo.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Ci jo Icrael gulubu cik pa Rwot, gumiyo taun madito magi bot Lulevi kacel ki lobo me oletgi kun gikwanyo ki ikom ginaleyagi.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Kwir okwongo poto ikom jo Kokat ci Lulevi ma likwayo pa ajwaka Aron gulimo taun madito apar wiye adek ki bot jo pa Juda, jo pa Cimeon ki jo pa Benjamin kun onongo kiyerogi ki bolo kwir.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Jo Kokat mudonge gulimo taun madito apar ki bot jo pa Epraim, jo pa Dan ki nucu kaka pa jo pa Manace ma oporo dogolagi.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Jo pa Gercon gulimo taun madito apar wiye adek ki bot jo pa Icakar, jo pa Acer, jo pa Naputali ki nucu kaka pa Manace ma i Bacan ma oporo dogolagi.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Jo pa Merari gulimo taun madito apar wiye aryo ki bot jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki jo pa Jabulon ma oporo dogolagi.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Taun madito magi ki lobo olet ma ingetgi jo Icrael gumiyo bot jo pa Levi kun kibolo kwir, kit macalo Rwot yam ociko ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Taun madito ma gulimo ki bot kaka pa Juda ki Cimeon, <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />ma kimiyo bot likwayo pa Aron, ma gin aye dogola acel ikin jo pa Kokat ma Lulevini nyinggi ene. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Kwir okwongo poto ikomgi ci kimiyo botgi Kiriat-arba, en aye Kebron, ma i lobo godi me Juda, kacel ki lobo olet ma orume dyere. Arba obedo kwaro pa jo Anak. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Ento poti ducu ma inget taun madit meno, ki taun matino ma ingete yam onongo kimiyogi woko bot Kaleb wod pa Jepune me bedo mere.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Kimiyo Kebron ki lobo olet ma ingete bot likwayo pa ajwaka Aron, en aye taun madit me laro lunek dano, Libna ki lobo olete, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Jatir ki olete, Ectemoa ki olete, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Kolon ki olete, Debir ki olete, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Ain ki olete, Juta ki olete, Bet-cemec ki olete, taun madito abongwen ma oa ki bot kaka aryonu. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Ka dok kimiyo botgi taun madito magi ma oa ki bot jo pa Benjamin:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 21:17">Gibeon, Geba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatot ki Almon, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Taun madito ducu ma kimiyo bot likwayo pa ajwaka Aron gubedo apar wiye adek, kun taun madit acel acel tye ki lobo me olet ingete.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Lulevi me dogola mogo pa jo pa Kokat mudong gulimo taun madito magi ma i lobo pa jo pa Epraim: <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Cekem, taun madit me laro lunek dano ma i lobo godi me Epraim, ki olete, Gejer ki olete, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibjaim ki olete, Bet-koron ki olete, taun madito angwen. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Ki bot kaka pa Dan gulimo Elteke, Gibeton, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Aijalon ki Gat-rimmon, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Ki bot nucu kaka pa Manace gulimo Taanak ki Gat-rimmon ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Kitmeno, taun madito ducu ma kimiyo bot dogola mukene pa jo Kokat gubedo apar, kun taun madit acel acel tye ki lobo olet ingete.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Jo Gercon ma idogola mukene pa Lulevi gulimo taun madito aryo ki bot nucu kaka pa Manace, gin aye Golan ma i Bacan ma taun madit me laro lunek dano ki olet ma ingete, ki Be-eciterot ki olete. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Ki bot jo Icakar gulimo Kicion, Daberat, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Jarmut ki En-ganim, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Ki bot jo Acer gulimo Mical, Abdon, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Kelkat ki Rekob, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Ki bot jo Naputali gulimo Kedec i Galilaya, taun madit me laro lunek dano, Kamot-dor ki Kartan, taun madito adek ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Kitmeno, taun madito ducu ma kimiyo bot dogola mapatpat pa jo Gercon obedo apar wiye adek, kun taun madit acel acel tye ki lobo olet ingete.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Lulevi mukene, ma gin aye dogola pa jo Merari, gulimo ki bot jo Jabulon Jokneam, Karta, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimna ki Nakalal, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Ki bot jo pa Reuben gulimo Bejer, Jakaj, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemot ki Mepat, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Ki bot jo pa Gad gulimo Ramot ma i Gilead matye taun madit me laro lunek dano, Makanaim, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Kecbon ki Jajer, taun madito angwen ki olet ma ingetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Taun madito ducu ma kimiyo bot dogola mapatpat pa jo pa Merari, en aye bot dogola pa Lulevi mudonge, obedo apar wiye aryo.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Taun madito ducu pa Lulevi ma gitye i dye lobo pa jo Icrael gubedo pyere angwen wiye aboro, ki oletgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Taun madit acel acel onongo tye ki lobo olet ma orume dyere; gangigi ducu gubedo kitmeno.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gucamo lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Kitmeno, Rwot omiyo bot jo Icrael lobo ducu mayam okwongo pire ni ebimiyo bot kwarogi; gucamo lobone kitmeno, ci gubedo iye. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Rwot omiyogi yweyo i kabedogi ducu kit mayam okwongo bot kwarogi; pe lamerokgi acel mo ocung inyimgi, pien Rwot onongo omiyo lumerokgi ducu i cinggi. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Lok mabeco ducu mayam onongo Rwot ociko ki jo Icrael ocobe kakare, pe onen lok mo ma pe otime.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yocwa ocwalo kaka ma tung kunyango me Jordan i lobogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Lacen Yocwa olwongo jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace, <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:20-32">Wel 32:20-32</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Yoc 1:12-15</ref></char></note>ci owaco botgi ni, “Wutyeko cobo gin ducu mayam Moses latic pa Rwot ocikowu kwede, dok wubedo ka woro doga bene i lok ducu ma acikowu kwede. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Pe wubwoto utmegiwu pi lwak kare man ducu nio kwede wa onyo, ento wuketo cwinywu kalubu lok ma Rwot Lubangawu ocikowu kwede. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Ci kombedi Rwot Lubangawu dong otyeko miyo yweyo bot utmegiwu kit mayam ocikogi kwedeni; pieno wun dong wuloke wudok cen i pacowu kama lobo mayam wucamo odoko mewu tye iye, i lobo mayam Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo botwu loka tung kunyango me Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Ber wugwoke kalubu cik ki lok ducu mayam Moses latic pa Rwot ocikowu kwede ni wumar Rwot Lubangawu, kun wulubu yone ducu ki lok ma en ociko. Wumok ikome liking kun wutiyo bote ki cwinywu ducu ki tipu komwu ducu.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Kitmeno, Yocwa ocikogi kun lamo gum ikomgi, ka dong ocwalogi kwede tugi, ci gudok i pacogi.<verse eid="JOS 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Onongo Moses yam omiyo dul lobo bot nucu kaka pa Manace i Bacan, ento nucu kakane mukene Yocwa aye omiyo lobo botgi kacel ki utmegigi ma i lobo ma i loka Jordan tung kupotoceng. Ikare ma Yocwa cwalogi i pacogi, en olamo gum ikomgi, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />kun waco botgi ni, “Dong wudok cen i pacowu ki lonyo madwong, ki lwak lim makwo mapol, ki ryal, jabu, mola, nyonyo ki bongigu. Wucit wupok jami ma wuyako ki bot lukworwu ikinwu ki utmegiwu.” <verse eid="JOS 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Kitmeno jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace gucako dok i pacogi; gupoke woko ki ikom jo Icrael i Cilo matye i lobo Kanaan, ci gucito i lobo Gilead, en aye lobogi kikome mayam gulimo, kit ma Rwot onongo ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cano Keno Tyer Loka Jordan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Ka guo i Gelilot inget kulu Jordan, matye i lobo Kanaan, ci jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace gucano keno tyer inget Jordan, keno tyer madit mada. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Ci jo Icrael guwinyo lok ni, “Jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace gucano keno tyer iwang lobo me Kanaan, i Gelilot ma inget Jordan ma okemo lobo pa jo Icrael.”<verse eid="JOS 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Ka jo Icrael guwinyo pire, ci lwak jo Icrael ducu gucoke i Cilo kayubu lweny ikomgi.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Ci jo Icrael gucwalo Finekaci wod pa ajwaka Eleajar bot jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace i lobo Gilead, <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />kacel ki rwodi apar. Gucwalo latela acel ki i kaka acel acel pa jo Icrael, kun latela acel acel obedo ladit maloyo dogola mo ikin kaka pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Ka dong guo bot jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace ma i lobo Gilead, ci guwaco botgi ni, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:13-14">Nwo 12:13-14</ref></char></note>“Lwak pa Rwot ducu guwaco botwu kit man ni, ‘Man kit robo dog ango ma wutimo ikom Lubanga pa Icrael, ma omiyo wuloke woko wuweko lubu kor Rwot, wucano keno tyer pirwu kenwu, wucako jemo woko ikom Rwot? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Wel 25:1-9</ref></char></note>Bal ma otime i Peor pud pe oromowu ce, mayam omiyo two gemo opoto gire ikom lwak pa Rwot? Pud peya walonye ikom bal meno wa onyo, <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />ci dok pud wumede ki weko lubu kor Rwot ikare man? Kace dok wujemo woko ikom Rwot tin, ci diki kiniga bimake ikom lwake jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Ento koni ka lobowu obedo keni, ci wudok cen i lobo pa Rwot kama kema pa Rwot ocung iye, wek wuyer dul lobo mo ikinwa kunu wek wubed iye; ento pe dok wujem ikom Rwot aye, nyo pe wulokwa wadok lujemo pi cano keno tyer mukene ma dok pat ki keno tyer pa Rwot Lubangawa kikome. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1-26">Yoc 7:1-26</ref></char></note>Akan wod pa Jera yam pe ongayo wang Rwot pi lok ma dok ikom jami ma onongo kidyerogi woko bot Rwot, ci omiyo akemo opoto ikom lwak jo Icrael ducu? Dok en pe oto kene pi balenu.’”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Ci jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace gudok iye bot ludito wi dogola pa jo Icrael ni, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Rwot aye Lubanga maloyo lubanga mukene ducu! En aye Lubanga maloyo lubanga mukene ducu! En ngeyo, dok en miyo Icrael bene ngeyo! Kace man otime pi jemo nyo pi ngayo wang Rwot, ci tin pe wubwotwa makwo. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Kace wacano keno tyer pi weko lubu kor, Rwot, nyo kace wacano pi tyero iye gitum awanga, nyo gityer me moko kwon, nyo gityer me berbedo, ci wek Rwot kikome aye ocul kwor ikomwa. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Pe kumeno gire, ento wan onongo watimo pi lworo pi kare ma bibino anyim, pien likwayowu gibiwaco bot likwayowa ni, ‘Wun wuwaco ni Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael obedo Lubangawu ningning? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Rwot dong otyeko keto kulu Jordan obedo wang lobo ikin wan ki wun; pieno wun jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad pe wutye ki wang pok mo ikom Rwot.’ Lok macalo meno bimiyo likwayowu gijuku likwayowa, ci miyo giweko woro Rwot woko. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />En aye lok ma omiyo wawaco ni, ‘Wek wacan keno tyer, pe pi gitum awanga nyo pi tumu iye gitum mo, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />ento watim me bedo caden ikin wan ki wun, ki ikin yalwak ma bilubuwa i anyim, ma nyutu ni wan bene waworo Rwot ki gitum awanga ki gitum mukene ki gityer me berbedo ma watyero inyime; wek likwayowu pe guwac bot likwayowa ikare ma bibino anyim ni wun pe wutye ki wang pok mo ikom Rwot. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Onongo watamo ni, ka gibilok botwa kitmeno, nyo bot likwayowa ikare me anyim, ci wabidok iye ni, nen kit keno tyer mayam kwariwa gucano ma oporo keno tyer pa Rwot kikome. Pe gucano pi gitum awanga nyo pi tyero kit gitum mo, ento me bedo caden ikin wan ki wun.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Wan onongo pe wayube pi jemo ikom Rwot wa ki acel, nyo me weko lubu kor Rwot ikare man pi cano keno tyer me tumu gitum awanga, nyo me tyero gityer me moko kwon nyo kadi kit gitum mo me ameda ikom keno tyer pa Rwot Lubangawa ma inyim kemaneni!”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Ka ajwaka Finekaci ki lutela ma luwi lwak, ki ludito kaka ma i Icrael ma onongo gitye kacel kwede guwinyo lok pa jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki jo Manace ma gudok iyeni, ci cwinygi obedo yom mada. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Finekaci wod pa ajwaka Eleajar owaco bot jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki jo pa Manace ni, “Tin dong waniang atir, ni Rwot tye i dyewa, pien wun pe wutimo man pi robo dog Rwot; kombedi dong wutyeko laro jo Icrael woko ki i cing Rwot.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Lacen Finekaci wod pa ajwaka Eleajar ki rwodi ducu gua ki bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad ma i lobo Gilead, gudok i Kanaan bot jo Icrael matye kunu, ci gudwoko lok botgi. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Lok ma gudwoko botgi oyomo cwiny jo Icrael mada, ci gupwoyo Lubanga, pe dok gumede kiloko lok me cito kalweny ikomgi nyo pi balo lobo ma jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad gibedo iyeni woko. <verse eid="JOS 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad gucako nying keno tyer ma gucano ni, Caden, pien guwaco ni, “Man aye bedo me caden ikin wan ki wun mamoko ni Rwot en aye Lubanga.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">Cik pa Yocwa me agiki bot lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Ka kare okato malac ma Rwot dong otyeko miyo yweyo bot jo Icrael ikom lumerokgi ducu mayam orumugi dyereni, ki onongo Yocwa bene dong otii woko, mwaka me dite dong onongo dwong. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Ci en olwongo jo Icrael ducu bote, ki ludongogi, ludito wigi, lungolkopgi ki ludito ticgi ducu, ci owaco botgi ni, “An kombedi dong atii woko, mwaka me dita dong bene dwong. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Wun dong wutyeko neno gin ducu ma Rwot Lubangawu otiyo pirwu ikom rok magi ducu, pien Rwot Lubangawu aye obedo kalweny ikomgi pirwu. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Nen ka dong atyeko poko lobo pa rok mapatpat ma pud gudong ikinwu me bedo lobo pa kakawu, kacel ki rok ducu mayam dong aloyogi woko, cake ki i Jordan nio kwede wa i Nam Mediterranean tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Rwot Lubangawu bidirogi woko cen kun ryemogi woko ki inyimwu, ci wubicamo lobogi kit mayam Rwot Lubangawu ocike kwede botwuni. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Pimeno wucung matek kun wulubu gin ducu ma kicoyo i buk me Cik pa Moses, pe wubwot mo wa ki acel iye. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Pe wunyebe me bedo kacel ki lurok ma pud gudong i kinwuni, dok pe wutuc nying lubangagi, nyo pe wukwong kwong mo ki nying lubangagi, nyo pe wuworgi, nyo pe bene wuryebe inyimgi. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Ento wumok wunu liking ikom Rwot Lubangawu kit ma wubedo katimone o kwede wa onyooni. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Rwot dong otyeko ryemo rok madito ki matego woko ki inyimwu; kun bene ngat mo peya onen ma obedo ki twero me cung inyimwu. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:22">Nwo 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:30">32:30</ref></char></note>Ci dano acel mo ki ikinwu romo ryemo jo alip kulu, pien Rwot Lubangawu aye tye kalweny pirwu kit mayam owaco botwu. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Dong ba, myero wugwoke matek, wunen ni wumaro Rwot Lubangawu; <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />pien ka wudok cen kun wuribe ki lurok ma gudong ikinwu, ki kace wucako nyome kwedgi kun wunyomo anyiragi ki dok gin bene ginyomo anyirawu, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />ci wunge atir ni, Rwot Lubangawu pe dok bimede ki ryemo lumerokwu woko ki inyimwu; ento gin aye gibidoko macalo owic ki layuta me cikowu, ki odoo gayi me jwato pyerwu ki okutu me cobo wangwu, ci bibedo lit adada, nio ka wubito wutum woko ki i lobo man maber ma Rwot Lubangawu dong omiyo botwuni.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />Kombedi an dong acok to. Wun bene wungeyo ki i cwinywu wa ki tipu komwu ducu ni, gin mabeco ducu mayam Rwot Lubangawu ociko pirwu gin ducu gucobe kakare, pe tye acel mo ma pe otime. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Ento kit mayam Rwot Lubangawu ocobo lok ducu mabeco mayam ociko pirwuni, kitmeno bene Rwot dok bikelo gin ducu maracu ikomwu, nio ka bityekowu woko ki i lobo man maber ma en omiyo botwuni. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Kace wuturu gicike pa Rwot Lubangawu mayam ocikowu kwede kun wucito ka woro lubanga mogo mukene, ma wuryebe inyimgi, ci kiniga bimako Rwot ikomwu, ci wubito wutum woko oyotoyot ki i lobo man maber ma en omiyo botwu.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yocwa oroco Gicike ki lwak i Cekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Lacen Yocwa dok ocoko kaka pa jo Icrael ducu kacel i Cekem; ci olwongo ludongo ki luwi lwak, lungolkop ki ludito tic ma i Icrael ducu, ci gubino gurye inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Ci <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:27">Aca 11:27</ref></char></note>Yocwa owaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, ‘Kwariwu yam con gubedo i lobo ma loka kulu Euprate, ci gubedo ka woro lubanga mogo mukene. Ngat acel ikin gi obedo Tera ma won Abraim ki Nakor. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-9">Aca 12:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:1-3">21:1-3</ref></char></note>An yam akwanyo kwarowu Abraim woko ki i lobo ma loka kulu Euprate, ci atelo wiye akelo awok kwede i lobo Kanaan ducu, dok amiyo likwaye gunya mapol. Amiyo bote Icaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:24-26">Aca 25:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 36:8">36:8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:5">Nwo 2:5</ref></char></note>dok amiyo bot Icaka lutinone Yakobo ki Ecau. Ci amiyo lobo godi me Ceir bot Ecau me bedo mere, ento Yakobo ki lutinone gucito meggi wa i Ejipt. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-12:42">Nia 3:1—12:42</ref></char></note>Ka dok acwalo Moses ki Aron, ci ayelo jo Ejipt ki gemo mapol ki kit gin ducu ma atiyo ikin gi; ka lacen akwanyowu woko ki kunu. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:1-31">Nia 14:1-31</ref></char></note>Akwanyo kwariwu woko ki i Ejipt ci wuo wa i dog nam. Jo Ejipt guryemo kor kwariwu ki gadigadi lweny ki aguragura o kwede wa i dog Nam Makwar. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Ka kwariwu gukok bot Rwot Lubanga, ci en oketo mutu ikinwu ki jo Ejipt, ka dok odwoko nam cen ikomgi ci omwonyogi woko ducu. Yam wuneno ki wangwu gin ma atimo ikom jo Ejipt, dok wubedo i tim pi lwak kare malac.<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka dok akelowu i lobo pa jo Amor ma gubedo loka Jordan tungcel. Ci gulwenyo kwedwu ento amiyogi i cingwu; wumako lobogi wucamo odoko mewu, ci atyekogi woko ki inyimwu. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-24:25">Wel 22:1—24:25</ref></char></note>Inge meno Balak wod pa Jipor, rwot me Moab, otinge olwenyo ikom jo Icrael; ka dok ocwalo kwena olwongo Balaam wod pa Beor ni obin wek ocenwu woko. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Ento an pe awinyo dog Balaam, ma omiyo en dok olamo gum ikomwu; kitmeno alarowu woko ki i cing Balak. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Yoc 3:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:1-21">6:1-21</ref></char></note> Ikare ma wukato loka Jordan, wubino i Jeriko, ci jo Jeriko gulwenyo ikomwu, kacel ki jo Amor, jo Periji, jo Kanaan, jo Kit, jo Girgac, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc, ento amiyogi ducu i cingwu. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:28">Nia 23:28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:20">Nwo 7:20</ref></char></note>Ikare meno acoro pino jubi inyimwu pi ryemo luker pa jo Amor aryo ducu woko ki inyimwu; pe wun aye wuloyogi ki pala lucwanwu nyo atumwu. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10-11">Nwo 6:10-11</ref></char></note>Ci amiyo botwu lobo mayam pe wutiyo iye gin mo, ki taun madito mayam pe wun aye wugerogi, ci wubedo iye; wutye kacamo nyig olok ki nyig jeituni mayam pe wupitogi.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Pimeno dong wulwor Rwot Lubanga, dok wutii bote ki lengcwiny ki gen madwong. Wubol lwak lubanga mayam kwariwu gubedo kaworogi i lobo ma loka kulu Euprate ki i lobo Ejipt woko, wek dong wuwor Rwot keken. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Ka pe wumito woro Rwot, ci tin dong wuyer ngat ma wubitiyo bote, ka nyo wubiyero lubanga mayam kwariwu gutiyo botgi i lobo ma loka kulu Euprate, nyo lubanga pa jo Amor ma wubedo i lobogini. Ento an gira ki jo ma i oda ducu wabitiyo bot Rwot.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Lwak gudok iye ni, “Wan pe wabedo ki tam mo me bwoto Rwot pi tiyo bot lubanga mukene, <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />pien Rwot Lubangawa aye yam okwanyowa kacel ki kwariwa ki i lobo Ejipt, ki i ot kol me bedo opii. En otiyo lwak lanyut madito kun wan waneno, ogwokowa i yoo ducu ma wawoto iye ki ikom rok ducu ma wakato wawok ki ikin gi ni. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Rwot oryemo rok meno ducu woko ki i nyimwa, gin jo Amor mayam gubedo i loboni, ma omiyo wan wabitiyo bot Rwot, pien en aye Lubangawa.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Ento Yocwa dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Pe wutwero tiyo bot Rwot Lubanga, pien en Lubanga maleng, en Lubanga ma lanyeko. Pe bitimowu kica ikom tim aranyiwu ki balwu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Kace wubwoto Rwot kun wutiyo bot lubanga mogo pa lurok, ci en biloke katimowu marac ci tyekowu woko, kadi bed yam kong onongo otimowu maber.” <verse eid="JOS 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Ci lwak gugamo dog Yocwa ni, “Pe kumeno; wan giwa wabitiyo bot Rwot.” <verse eid="JOS 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Ci Yocwa dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Wun aye wudoko caden ikomwu kekenwu, pien dong wutyeko yero Rwot kun wuwaco ni, wubitiyo bote keken.” Ci lwak gugamo ni, “Wan aye caden giwa.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Ci Yocwa owaco botgi ni, “Wubol lubanga pa lurok ducu ma gitye ikinwu woko, wek wulok cwinywu odwog ikom Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael.” <verse eid="JOS 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ci lwak guwaco bot Yocwa ni, “Wabitiyo bot Rwot Lubangawa, dok wabiworo doge.” <verse eid="JOS 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Kitmeno Yocwa oketo gicike ki lwak inino meno, ci omiyo botgi cik mapol i Cekem inino meno kun nyutu kit ma myero gulub ki cik mapatpat ducu. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Ci Yocwa ocoyo lok magi ducu i buk me cik pa Lubanga; ci okwanyo got madit, ocibo ocung kunu ite yat kworo ma i Kabedo Maleng pa Rwot. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Yocwa dok owaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Nenu, got man aye bibedo caden ikomwa, pien otyeko winyo lok pa Rwot ducu ma en owaco botwa; ma omiyo en bedo lacaden ikomwu wek pe dok wukwer Lubangawu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Ka meno otum, ci Yocwa ociko lwak ci guket woko kun ngat acel acel odok i lobo ma oleyoni.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Yocwa ki pa Eleajar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JDG 2:6-10">Lung 2:6-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Ki inge lok meno ducu Yocwa wod pa Nun ma latic pa Rwot oto woko ma onongo mwaka me dite oromo miya acel ki apar. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:49-50">Yoc 19:49-50</ref></char></note>Ci guyiko kome i lobone kikome, i lobo mayam kimiyo bote, i Timnat-cera i lobo godi pa jo pa Epraim, tung kumalo me lobo Gaac.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Jo Icrael gutiyo bot Rwot ikare pa Yocwa ducu ki ikare pa ludongo ducu mayam gudong ka Yocwa dong oto. Gin jo ma onongo gingeyo tic ducu mayam Rwot otiyo pi jo Icrael.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 33:19">Aca 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">50:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Nia 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Jon 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Tic 7:16</ref></char>
    </note>Cogo kom Yucepu ma onongo yam jo Icrael gukelo ki i Ejipt kiyiko i Cekem i dul lobo mayam Yakobo owilo ki bot awobe pa Kamor ma won Cekem. En owilo ki dul lim maromo ryal miya acel. Ci Dul lobonu odoko lobo pa likwayo pa Yucepu matwal.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Ka Eleajar wod pa Aron bene oto, ci kiyiko kome i Gibea, i gang pa wode Finekaci mayam onongo kimiyo bote i taun ma i lobo godi pa jo pa Epraim.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>